<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">RRK11.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 ABAGABE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Ky'abagabe Eky'okubanza</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abagabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Bag</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKITABO KY'ABAGABE</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKY'OKUBANZA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okwemeka Sulemaani akiriho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Omugabe Daudi akaba akuzire munonga, ahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; n'obu baabaire bamushweka ebyeshweko, akaba atakibaasa kutagatirwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Nikyo abagaragwa be baamugiriire bati: Nyakusinga Omugabe, ka bakusherurire omwishiki empangare, agume akuheereze, kandi abyame omu kifuba kyawe, obone kutagatirwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Batyo basherura omwishiki murungi omuri Israeli yoona, baabona Abishaagi owa Shuneemu, baamureetera omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Omwishiki ogwo akaba ari murungi munonga, yaaba omuranga w'omugabe, yaaguma naamuheereza; kwonka omugabe tiyaamumanya.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:4">2 Sam 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:1">15:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Adoniya mutabani wa Hagisi yaayekuza, naagira ati: Niinyija kuba omugabe. Yaayeteeraho ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi, kandi n'abashaija makumi ataano b'okumwebembera. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Ishe akaba atakamugwisaga kubi naamugira ati: Ahabw'enki okozire oti n'oti? Akaba ari omushaija murungi munonga omu kureeba; kandi niwe yaabaire naakurata Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:23">2 Sam 20:23</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Adonia ogwo yaahanuura na Yoabu mwene Zeruiya n'Abiasaari omunyamurwa; baakwatanisa nawe, baamuhwera. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">2 Sam 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">23:8-39</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Zadoki omunyamurwa na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada, na Nasani nabi, na Shemei, na Rei, na bari bashaija ba Daudi amamanzi bakaba batakwataniise na Adoniya. <verse eid="1KI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adoniya yaatambira entaama n'ente n'eby'ebishaju haihi n'eibaare rya Zoheleesi, erihereraine na Eni-rogeli; yaayeta beene ishe batabani b'omugabe, n'abategyeki boona ab'omuri Yuda ab'obugabe; <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">2 Sam 12:24</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Nasani nabi na Benaaya n'abo bashaija amamanzi na Sulemaani mwene ishe tiyabeeta.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Bwanyima Nasani yaagira Batisheba nyina wa Sulemaani ati: Tohuriire Adoniya mwene Hagisi ku abaire omugabe, haza mukama waitu Daudi atarikukimanya? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Mbwenu nu, ija nkuhe obwengye, obone kukiza amagara gaawe n'aga mutabani waawe Sulemaani. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:30">1 Bag 1:30</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:9">1 Bus 22:9</ref>. </char></note> Irooko oze ow'omugabe Daudi, omugire oti: Nyakusinga Omugabe, torikwijuka ku waaraganiise omuzaana waawe noorahira oti: Buzimazima mutabani waawe Sulemaani niwe ariza aha ngoma naarugaho; kandi oti: Niwe arishutama aha kitebe kyangye ky'obugabe? Mbwenu ahabw'enki heemire Adoniya? <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Mbwenu ku oraabe nookigamba n'omugabe, naanye niinyija kutaahamu nkukuratiire, mpamye ebigambo byawe.<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Atyo Batisheba yaataaha omu kishengye ky'omugabe; (obwo omugabe akaba akuzire munonga, kandi Abishaagi owa Shuneemu niwe yaabaire naamuheereza). <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba yainama, yaatangirira omugabe; omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda ki? <verse eid="1KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, okarahira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, noogira omuzaana waawe oti: Buzimazima Sulemaani mutabani waawe niwe ariza aha ngoma naarugaho; kandi oti: Niwe arishutama aha kitebe kyangye ky'obugabe. <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Mbwenu reeba, Adoniya niwe ayemire, haza, Mukama wangye Omugabe, otarikukimanya. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Aitsire ente n'eby'ebishaju n'entaama bingi, yaabitamba, kandi yaayeta batabani b'omugabe boona, na Abiasaari omunyamurwa na Yoabu omukuru w'eihe, kwonka Sulemaani omwiru waawe tiyaamweta. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Mbwenu, Nyakusinga Omugabe, Abaisraeli boona niiwe bataireho amaisho, kubagambira orishutama aha kitebe kya mukama wangye omugabe yaarugaho. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:10">1 Bag 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Nyakusinga Omugabe, ku oraabe otakozire otyo, bwanyima ku ori gwejegyera waashanga baashwenkuru, nyowe na mutabani wangye Sulemaani turyabarwa nk'abacumwire.<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Batisheba ku yaabaire naakigamba n'omugabe, Nasani nabi yaataahamu. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Baagambira omugabe bati: Reeba, Nasani nabi ari aha. Ku yaahikire omu maisho g'omugabe, yainama omu maisho ge. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Nasani yaagira ati: Nyakusinga Omugabe, niiwe ogizire oti: Adoniya niwe ariza aha ngoma naarugaho, kandi niwe arishutama aha kitebe kyangye ky'obugabe? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:24">1 Sam 10:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba eri izooba yaashuuma, yaita ente n'eby'ebishaju n'entaama bingi munonga, yaabitamba, kandi yaayeta batabani b'omugabe boona na Yoabu omukuru w'eihe na Abiasaari omunyamurwa; mbwenu bari omu maisho ge nibarya nibanywa, nibagira bati: Omugabe Adoniya nakaramaare! <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:8">1 Bag 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:32">32</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyowe omwiru waawe, na Zadoki omunyamurwa na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada n'omwiru waawe Sulemaani tatwetsire. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Ekyo kirugire ahari mukama wangye omugabe, kandi otagambiire abairu baawe orishutama aha kitebe kyawe ky'obugabe waarugaho?<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Omugabe Daudi yaagira ati: Nyetera Batisheba. Batisheba yaija, yaayemerera omu maisho ge. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Omugabe yaarahira naagira ati: Nk'oku MUKAMA ari ohuriire, owaihire amagara gangye omu busaasi bw'emiringo yoona, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:13">1 Bag 1:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:17">17</ref>. </char></note> buzimazima nk'oku naakurahiire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli nimpamya nti: Mutabani waawe Sulemaani niwe ariza aha ngoma naarugaho, kandi niwe arishutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe omu mwanya gwangye, nikwo ndaagire eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 2:3">Neh 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Batisheba yainama, yaaramya omugabe naagira ati: Mukama wangye Omugabe Daudi nakaramaare!<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Omugabe Daudi yaagira ati: Muunyetere Zadoki omunyamurwa na Nasani nabi na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada. Nabo baija omu maisho ge. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Omugabe yaabagira ati: Mugyende n'abagaragwa ba mukama waanyu, mutembye mutabani wangye Sulemaani enyumbu yangye ahabwangye, mumushuumye Gihoni; <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:1">1 Sam 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:25">1 Bag 1:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:13">2 Bag 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:14">11:14</ref>. </char></note> ku muraahikyeyo, Zadoki omunyamurwa na Nasani nabi bamushukyeho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli; bwanyima muteere eikondere, mugire muti: Omugabe Sulemaani nakaramaare! <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Bwanyima mwije enyima ye, aije ashutame aha kitebe kyangye ky'obugabe; ahakuba aryaba omugabe omu mwanya gwangye; kandi niwe naataho kuba omugabe wa Israeli na Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Amiina! MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa mukama wangye omugabe nawe agire atyo. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 20:13">1 Sam 20:13</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku MUKAMA abaire ari na mukama wangye omugabe n'okuhitsya hati, abe nikwo yaaba na Sulemaani, atunguure ekitebe kye ky'obugabe okukira ekya mukama wangye omugabe Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Atyo Zadoki omunyamurwa na Nasani nabi na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada n'Abakeresi n'Abapelesi, baashuuma baatembya Sulemaani enyumbu y'omugabe Daudi, baamutwara Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:23-32">Kur 30:23-32</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:22">1 Bus 29:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Zab 89:20</ref>. </char></note> Zadoki omunyamurwa yaiha eihembe ry'amajuta omu Ihema, yaagashuka ahari Sulemaani. Baateera eikondere; abantu boona baagira bati: Omugabe Sulemaani nakaramaare! <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Abantu boona baagyenda bamukuratiire, nibateera obunyamurera, nibashemererwa n'okushemererwa kwingi, n'ensi yaashatuka ahabw'akaari kaabo.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya n'abagyenyi boona abu yaabaire aine, ku baabaire nibaheza bati kurya, baakihurira. Yoabu ku yaahuriire okugamba kw'eikondere, yaagira ati: Orwo rwari ruri omu rurembo n'orw'enki? <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:27">2 Sam 15:27</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba, yaayecura Yonasaani mwene Abiasaari omunyamurwa; Adoniya yaamugira ati: Taaha omu nju, ahakuba ori omwesigwa, kandi oreetsire amakuru marungi. <verse eid="1KI 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Yonasaani yaagarukamu Adoniya ati: Ngaaha! Mukama waitu omugabe Daudi yaayemeka Sulemaani; <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />kandi omugabe yaamwohereza na Zadoki omunyamurwa, na Nasani nabi, na Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada, hamwe n'Abakeresi n'Abapelesi; baamutembya enyumbu y'omugabe; <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />kandi Zadoki omunyamurwa na Nasani nabi baamushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe omuri Gihoni; abantu baarugayo nibashemererwa; n'ahabw'ekyo orurembo niruteera akaari. Ako niko kaari aku mwahurira. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1 Bus 29:23</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu Sulemaani ari aha kitebe ky'obugabe. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:31">Kut 47:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abagaragwa b'omugabe baija kushabira mukama waitu omugabe Daudi mugisha, nibagira bati: Ruhanga waawe atunguure eiziina rya Sulemaani rirangaanwe okukira eryawe, kandi n'obugabe bwe abugire obw'ekitiinisa okukira obwawe. Bwanyima omugabe yainama aha kitanda kye, yaaramya. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:6">2 Sam 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Zab 132:11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe yaagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, asiimwe, owampa omuntu ow'omu nda yangye kushutama aha kitebe kyangye ky'obugabe eri izooba, kandi n'amaisho gangye gakakireeba.<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Bwanyima abagyenyi ba Adoniya boona baatiina, baimuka baagyenda, buri muntu yaatoora ogwe. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:2">Kur 27:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:28">1 Bag 2:28</ref>. </char></note> Adoniya yaatiina Sulemaani; yaimuka, yaagyenda, yaakwata amahembe g'eitambiro. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Baagambira Sulemaani bati: Reeba, Adoniya atiinire omugabe Sulemaani; akwaitse amahembe g'eitambiro, naagira ati: Omugabe Sulemaani andahire eri izooba ku atarikwija kwita omwiru we na rurara. <verse eid="1KI 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Sulemaani yaagarukamu ati: Ku araayeyorekye ari omushaija omwesigwa, tiharikwija kugira kashokye na kamwe ak'aha mutwe gwe akaagwa ahansi; kwonka ku araabonekweho ekibi, naafa. <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Atyo omugabe Sulemaani yaatuma, baamwiha aha itambiro, yaija yainama omu maisho ge; Sulemaani yaamugira ati: Taaha owaawe.<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Obunaku bw'okufa kwa Daudi ku bwairiire haihi, yaayehangangiriza omutabani Sulemaani naamugira ati. <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:6">Yos 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 1:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:14">23:14</ref>. </char></note> Ndi haihi kugyenda, nk'ab'ensi boona oku bagyenda. Ba ow'amaani, oyeyorekye ori omushaija, <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:9">Bir 29:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:12">1 Bus 22:12</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 22:13">13</ref>. </char></note> okwate ebi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikukuragiira, okugyendera omu mihanda ye n'okukwata ebiragiro bye, n'ebi yaaragiire, n'ebyatairweho, kandi n'ebi yaahamize, nk'ebyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya Musa oku biri, obone kuba gye omu bi orikukora byona, kandi n'ei oraagyende yoona, <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:25">1 Bag 8:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:12">Zab 132:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA abone kuhamya ekigambo kye, eki yangambireho naagira ati: Abaana baawe ku baryerinda omu mitwarize yaabo, baagyendera omu maisho gangye omu mazima n'emitima yaabo yoona n'amagara gaabo goona, toribura oriza aha ngoma ya Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 3:27">2 Sam 3:27</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 18:5">18:5</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 18:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 18:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 20:10">20:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi noomanya oku Yoabu mwene Zeruiya yangizire, n'oku yaagizire abakuru babiri ab'amahe ga Israeli, Abuneeri, mwene Neeri, na Amasa mwene Yeseri, abu yaitsire naahoora enzigu, akasheesha eshagama omu biro by'obusingye nk'ori aha rugamba, akasiiga egyo shagama aha rukoba oru yaabaire ayezirikiise, n'aha nkaito ezi yaabaire ajwaire. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo otwaze nk'oku obwengye bwawe buri, kandi otariikiriza omutwe gwe gw'enju kushuuma okuzimu n'obusingye. <verse eid="1KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2 Sam 17:27-29</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 19:31-38">19:31-38</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka oryagirira embabazi beene Baruzilai Omunyagileadi, babarirwe omu barikuriira aha meeza yaawe; ahakuba obu naabaire mpungire Abusalomu mwene sho, nikwo bangiriire. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:18">2 Sam 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Bag 16:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, hariho Shimei mwene Geera, Omubenyamiini owa Bahurimu, owankyeenire okukyeena kubi munonga aha izooba eri naagiiriireho Mahanaimu; kwonka akaija kuntangirira Yorudani, naamurahira MUKAMA nimmugira nti: Tindikwitsa rurara. <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Kwonka mbwenu otarimubara nk'otaine rubanja; ahakuba ori omushaija w'obwengye; oryamanya eki oshemereire kumukora; kandi oryashuumya omutwe gwe gw'enju okuzimu, guriho eshagama.<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:7">2 Sam 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:21">1 Bag 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:29">Byak 2:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:36">13:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Daudi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4">2 Sam 5:4</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 5:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:26">1 Bus 29:26</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 29:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka ei Daudi yaamazire aha ngoma naategyeka Israeli ekahika makumi ana; emyaka mushanju akagitegyekyera Heburooni, kandi makumi ashatu n'eshatu, yaagitegyekyera Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1 Bus 29:23</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:1">2 Bus 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaashutama aha kitebe kya Daudi ishe; obugabe bwe bwahamibwa munonga.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okwita Adoniya na Yoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Adoniya mwene Hagisi yaija ahari Batisheba nyina wa Sulemaani. Batisheba yaamugira ati: Ni buhooro? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ni buhooro. <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nyine eki ndikwenda kukugambira. Nyin'omugabe ati: Ngambira. <verse eid="1KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:5">1 Bag 1:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:9">1 Bus 22:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 22:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:5-7">28:5-7</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Noomanya ku obugabe bwabaire buri obwangye, kandi Abaisraeli boona ku baabaire bantaireho amaisho, ngu mbategyekye; kwonka bwanyima kyahinduka bwaba obwa mwene tata, ahabw'okuba akabuheebwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Mbwenu nyine eki ndikwenda kushaba; otakinyima. Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Kigambe. <verse eid="1KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3">1 Bag 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Nshabira omugabe Sulemaani, ahakuba tarikwija kukwangira, ampe Abishaagi owa Shuneemu, mmushwere. <verse eid="1KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batisheba yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, niinyija kumukugambirira.<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Atyo Batisheba yaaza ow'omugabe kumumugambirira. Omugabe yaimuka kumubugana, yaamwinamira; bwanyima yaashutama aha kitebe kye ky'obugabe, yaaragiira ku bareetera nyina ekitebe, yaashutama aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Yaamugira ati: Nyine ekintu kikye eki ndikwenda kukushaba; kandi otakinyima. Omugabe yaamugira ati: Kinshabe, Mukaikuru wangye; tindikwija kukikwima. <verse eid="1KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Onu ati: Mbwenu ninkushaba oikirize Abishaagi owa Shuneemu ashwerwe Adoniya mwene sho. <verse eid="1KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:6">1 Bag 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:2">1 Bus 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 3:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Sulemaani yaagarukamu nyina ati: Ahabw'enki nooshabira Adoniya Abishaagi owa Shuneemu? Mushabire nu n'obugabe; ahabw'okuba ni mukuru wangye; kandi shabira na Abiasaari omunyamurwa na Yoabu mwene Zeruiya. <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Bwanyima omugabe Sulemaani yaarahira MUKAMA, naagira ati: Adoniya ku araabe atazizire eki kigambo, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11">2 Sam 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire, owantaireho, akaanyemeka omu mwanya gwa tata Daudi, kandi onyombekyeire eka nk'oku yaaraganiise, buzimazima eri izooba Adoniya naitwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">2 Sam 8:18</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe Sulemaani yaatuma Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada; yaamuteera yaafa.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1 Sam 22:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:24">2 Sam 15:24</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 15:29">29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omugabe yaagira Abiasaari omunyamurwa ati: Irooko oze Anatoosi omu kibanja kyawe; ahakuba oshemereire kwitwa. Kwonka mbwenu tindikukwita, ahabw'okuba okeekorera eshanduukye ya Mukama RUHANGA omu maisho ga tata Daudi, kandi okabonabona na tata omuri byona ebi yaabonabonesiibwemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">1 Sam 2:27-36</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Sulemaani yaabinga Abiasaari omu bunyamurwa, ngu arekye kuba omunyamurwa wa MUKAMA; yaahikiiriza atyo ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaagambire ahari Eli omuri Shiilo.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 18:2">2 Sam 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:7">1 Bag 1:7</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 1:50">50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Egyo nkuru ku yaahikire Yoabu, yaahungira omu Ihema rya MUKAMA, yaakwata amahembe g'eitambiro; ahabw'okuba akaba akwataniise na Adoniya, n'obu araabe atarakwataniise na Abusalomu. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Kandi baagambira omugabe Sulemaani bati: Yoabu yaahungira omu Ihema rya MUKAMA; kandi reeba, ari aha itambiro. Sulemaani yaayohereza Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada, ati: Irooko omwite. <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Atyo Benaaya yaahika aha Ihema rya MUKAMA, yaamugira ati: Omugabe yaagira ngu, Orugyeyo. Onu ati: Ngaaha! Ka ngwe aha. Benaaya yaagaruka yaagambira omugabe ati: Oku nikwo Yoabu yangira, kandi nikwo yangarukamu. <verse eid="1KI 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:14">Kur 21:14</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:33">Kub 35:33</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaamugira ati: Okore nk'oku yaagamba; omwite, omuziikye, obone kwiha ahariinye n'aha nju ya tata orubanja rw'eshagama ei Yoabu yaaseeseire busha. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:5">1 Bag 2:5</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA naija kumuhoora, asheeshe eshagama ye, naamutura abantu babiri abu yaitsize rurara, omugurusi wangye Daudi atakimanyire, haza baabaire bari abantu abarikumukira oburungi n'okuhikiirira, nibo Abuneeri mwene Neeri, omukuru w'eihe rya Israeli, na Amasa mwene Yeseri, omukuru w'eihe rya Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Okwo nikwo Yoabu arihoorwa naaturwa eshagama yaabo, we n'oruzaaro rwe ebiro byona; kwonka Daudi n'oruzaaro rwe n'enju ye n'obugabe bwe biryagira obusingye oburikuruga ahari MUKAMA ebiro byona. <verse eid="1KI 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Atyo Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada yaagarukayo, yaamuteera, yaamwita; baamuziika omu ka ye, ahu yaabaire atwire omu ihamba. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:4">1 Bag 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:22">1 Bus 29:22</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaata Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada omu mwanya gwe kuba omukuru w'eihe; kandi yaata Zadoki omunyamurwa omu mwanya gwa Abiasaari.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okuhoora Shimei enzigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Bwanyima omugabe yaatuma ahari Shimei, yaamugira ati: Oyeyombekyere enju Yerusaalemu, ogigumemu, kandi otarigirugamu kugira ahandi hoona ahu waaza. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Ahakuba eizooba ri orirugayo okambuka akagyera Kidirooni, omanyire kimwe ku otaribura kufa, kandi eshagama yaawe niiwe eribaho. <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei yaagarukamu omugabe ati: Ebi wangambira ni birungi; nyowe omwiru waawe niinyija kutwaza, nka Mukama wangye Omugabe oku wandagiira. Atyo Shimei yaamara ebiro bingi ari Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Ku haahingwireho emyaka eshatu, abahuuku ba Shimei babiri baacwa, baaza owa Akishi mwene Maaka, omugabe wa Gaasi. Bwanyima bagambira Shimei bati: Abahuuku baawe bari Gaasi. <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Shimei yaimuka yaatandiika endogoya ye, yaaza Gaasi owa Akishi kusherura abahuuku be; atyo yaagyenda, yaabaiha Gaasi. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Bwanyima Sulemaani ku yaagambiirwe ngu Shimei arugire Yerusaalemu, yaaza Gaasi, kandi yaagaruka, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />omugabe yaatuma ahari Shimei, yaamugira ati: Nkakurahiza MUKAMA, naakwehanangiririza kimwe ninkugira nti: Omanyire kimwe ngu, eizooba ri orirugayo, okagira ahandi hoona ahu waaza, oryafa? Naiwe wangarukamu oti: Ebi waagamba ni birungi; niinyikiriza kubyorobera. <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Mbwenu ahabw'enki torinzire ndahiro ei waarahiire ahari MUKAMA, n'ekiragiro eki naakwehanangiriize? <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaagira Shimei ati: Noomanya omu mutima gwawe ebibi byona ebi waakozire tata Daudi; n'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA naija kukuhoora ahabw'obubi bwawe. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:5">Enf 25:5</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omugabe Sulemaani aryaheebwa omugisha, kandi ekitebe ky'obugabe bwa Daudi kiryagumaho ebiro byona omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">1 Bag 2:12</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaragiira Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada kumwita; yaashohora, yaamuteera, yaafa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Butyo obugabe bwahamibwa omu mikono ya Sulemaani.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:10">1 Bag 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:1">7:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:15">9:15</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:11">2 Bus 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaakwatanisa na Faraho omugabe wa Misri, yaashwera muhara we, yaamutaasya omu rurembo rwa Daudi, okuhitsya obu yaaherize kwombeka nyaruju ye ahabwe, n'enju ya MUKAMA kandi n'orugo rw'okwehinguririza Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:2">Bir 12:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu bakaba bahongyera empongano zaabo omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, ahakuba hakaba hatakombekirwe nju ahabw'eiziina rya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Bir 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:6">1 Bag 3:6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 3:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani yaakunda MUKAMA, yaagyendera omu biragiro bya Daudi ishe; kwonka yaaguma naatambira ebitambo omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, kandi naayotererayo obubaane.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okushaba Ruhanga obwengye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:39">1 Bus 16:39</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:29">21:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaza Gibeoni kutambirayo ebitambo, ahabw'okuba omwanya ogurikukira obukuru ogw'okuramizamu niyo gwabaire guri. Atyo yaatambirayo ebitambo rukumi aha itambiro. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:7-12">2 Bus 1:7-12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:3">2 Bus 1:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 1:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 12:6">Kub 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:2">1 Bag 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:9">11:9</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani ku yaabaire akiri Gibeoni, MUKAMA yaamweyoreka omu kirooto nyekiro; Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Shaba eki orikwenda ngu nkuhe. <verse eid="1KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:4">1 Bag 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 15:2">Zab 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani yaagira ati: Okaba ogirira omwiru waawe tata Daudi embabazi nyingi, nk'oku yaabaire agyendera omu maisho gaawe omu mazima n'omu kuhikiirira n'omutima ogugororokire ahariiwe; mbwenu omucumiire omugisha ogu omuhango, waamuha omwana w'okuza aha ngoma ye, nk'oku kiri eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:5">1 Bus 28:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:1">29:1</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati, MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, ogizire omwiru waawe omugabe omu mwanya gwa tata Daudi, n'obu ndaabe ndi omwana muto, ntarikumanya oku ndaashohore, n'oku ndaataahe. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:6">Bir 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:16">Kut 13:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyowe, omwiru waawe, ndi ahagati y'abantu baawe abu waatooraine, eihanga rihango munonga, eritarikubaasa kubarwa. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:1">Zab 72:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 72:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:14">Heb 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Yak 1:5</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ohe omwiru waawe omutima ogurikwetegyereza kutegyeka abantu baawe, mbone kutaanisa ekibi n'ekirungi; mbwenu n'oha orikubaasa kutegyeka eihanga ryawe eri erihango?<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Okwo kushaba kwa Sulemaani kwashemeza MUKAMA ahabw'okushaba ekigambo ekyo. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okushaba ekigambo ekyo, oteeshabire kuhangaara, nari obutungi, nari okushabira abazigu baawe kufa, kureka okeeshabira obwengye bw'okumanya ebihikire, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:29-31">1 Bag 4:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 5:12">5:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 10:23">10:23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 10:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 1:16">Mub 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:14">1 Yoh 5:14</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 5:15">15</ref>. </char></note> reeba, naakora nk'oku ekigambo kyawe kiri. Naakuha omutima gw'obwengye kandi ogurikwetegyereza; tihakabahoga orikwingana naiwe omu baakubandiize, kandi n'omu barikukurata taribaho. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21-24">1 Bag 4:21-24</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:16">Enf 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naakuha n'ebi otaashaba, obutungi n'ekitiinisa; tiharibaho ondiijo mugabe oringana naiwe ebiro byawe byona. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:5">1 Bag 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:2">Enf 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku origyendera omu mihanda yangye, waayorobera ebyatairweho n'ebiragiro byangye, nk'oku sho Daudi yaabaire abigyenderamu, ndyayongyera aha myaka yaawe.<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Sulemaani yaasisiimuka, yaashanga kiri ekirooto. Bwanyima yaija Yerusaalemu, yaayemerera omu maisho g'eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, yaatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya, n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye; kandi yaateekyera abairu be boona obugyenyi.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okucwa orubanja rw'abakazi babiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Bwanyima abakazi babiri, abaabaire bari baamaraaya, baija, baayemerera omu maisho g'omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Omukazi omwe yaagira ati: Nyakusinga Mukama wangye, nyowe n'omukazi ogu nituraara omu nju emwe. Ku tubaire turi hamwe omuri egyo nju, naazaara omwana. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Ku mbaire mmazire ebiro bishatu nzaire, omukazi ogu nawe yaazaara; kandi tubaire turi twenka, hataine ondiijo oriho omuri egyo nju, kureka itwe twembi. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Ku bubaire buri nyekiro omwana w'omukazi ogu yaafa ahabw'okumubyamira. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />We nikwo kwimuka omu itumbi, nyowe omuzaana waawe ngwejegyeire, akaanyiha omwana wangye aha rubaju, akamubyamya omu kifuba kye, akareeta owe ofiire, akamubyamya omu kifuba kyangye. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Ku nyimukire kare omu kasheeshe kwontsya omwana wangye, naashanga afiire; kwonka ku ngiire kumwetegyereza bwaseesire, naashanga atari mwana wangye, ou nzaire. <verse eid="1KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Kwonka ogu mukazi yaagira ati: Ngaaha, omwana ohuriire n'owangye; ofiire n'owaawe. Ow'okubanza ati: Ngaaha, ofiire n'owaawe, ohuriire niwe wangye. Nikwo baabigambire batyo omu maisho g'omugabe.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Bwanyima omugabe yaagira ati: Mbwenu omwe naagira ati: Ohuriire n'owangye, ofiire niwe waawe; ondiijo ati: Ngaaha, ofiire n'owaawe, ohuriire niwe wangye. <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nimundeetere rurara. Baagimureetera. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Ogwo mwana ohuriire, mumucwemu ebicweka bibiri; kimwe mukihe omwe, ekindi mukihe ondiijo. <verse eid="1KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:15">Isa 49:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:9">1 Bag 3:9</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 3:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 3:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omukazi nyina w'omwana ohuriire, ahabw'okusaasibwa omwana we, yaagira omugabe ati: Mukama wangye, omwana ohuriire mumuhe, otamwita na kakye. Kwonka omukazi ondiijo yaagira ati: Tarikwija kuba wangye nari owaawe; bamucwemu ebicweka bibiri. <verse eid="1KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Omugabe nikwo kugira ati: Omwana ogwo ohuriire mutamwita na kakye, mumuhe omukazi ow'okubanza, ahabw'okuba niwe nyina. <verse eid="1KI 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Kandi Abaisraeli boona baahurira oku omugabe acwire orwo rubanja, baamutiina, ahabw'okuba bakareeba obwengye bwa Ruhanga bw'okucwa emanja z'oburyo buri omuriwe.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abategyeki abu Sulemaani yaataireho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaaba omugabe wa Israeli yoona; <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />kandi aba nibo bategyeki bakuru abu yaabaire aine; Azaria mwene Zadoki akaba ari omunyamurwa, <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">2 Sam 8:16</ref>. </char></note> Elihorefu na Ahiya beene Shiisha bakaba bari abahandiiki; Yehoshafaati mwene Ahiluudi akaba ari omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho; <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:35">1 Bag 2:35</ref>. </char></note> Benaaya mwene Yehoyaada akaba ari omukuru w'eihe; Zadoki na Abiasaari bakaba bari abanyamurwa; <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:7">1 Bag 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Azaria mwene Nasani ari omukuru w'abatware; Zabudi mwene Nasani akaba ari omunyamurwa, kandi munywani w'omugabe; <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:14">1 Bag 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:15">9:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:18">12:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahishaari akaba ari omukuru w'ekikaari na Adoniramu mwene Abuda ari omukuru w'eby'emirimo.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Kandi Sulemaani akaba aine abatware ikumi na babiri omuri Israeli yoona, abo nibo baabaire batoijera omugabe n'ab'omu ka ye boona eby'okurya; buri omwe akaba aragiirwa kureeta eby'okurya by'okwezi kumwe omu mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Aga nigo maziina gaabo; Benihuuri ow'omu nsi y'ebibungo ya Efuraimu; <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Benidekere owa Makazi, Shaalubiimu, Betishemeshi na Eloni-besihanani; <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Benihesedi owa Aruboosi, (kandi niwe yaabaire atwara Sooko n'ensi yoona eya Heferi); <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:2">Yos 11:2</ref>. </char></note> Ben-abinadabu owa Nafati-doori yoona, (kandi akaba ashweire muhara wa Sulemaani orikwetwa Tafasi). <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana, mwene Ahiluudi, owa Tanaki, Megido na Besi-sheani yoona aha rubaju rwa Zaretaani orwa ifo ya Yezereeli, okuruga Besi-sheani okuhika Abeeli-mehola, kandi n'okuhika seeri ya Yokimeamu; <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:41">Kub 32:41</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:4">Bir 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:3">1 Bag 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Benigeberi owa Ramosi-gileadi, (kandi akaba naatwara tauni za Yairi mwene Manaase ez'omuri Gileadi, n'ekyanga kya Arugoobi, eky'omuri Bashani, ekyabaire kirimu endembo makumi mukaaga ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare eziine amarembo g'enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi z'emiringa); <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwene Ido, owa Mahanaimu; <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaazi owa Nafutaali (kandi nawe niwe yaabaire ashweire muhara wa Sulemaani orikwetwa Basemaasi); <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana mwene Hushai owa Asheri na Bealoosi; <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafaati mwene Parua, owa Isakaari; <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei mwene Ela, owa Benyamiini; <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:8-10">Bir 3:8-10</ref>. </char></note> na Geberi mwene Uuri, ow'ensi ya Gileadi, n'ensi ya Sihooni omugabe w'Abaamori na Ogi omugabe wa Bashani. Kandi omuri Yuda hakaba harimu omutware omwe. <verse eid="1KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Kut 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:8">1 Bag 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda n'Abaisraeli bakaba bari baingi nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja, nibarya, nibanywa, kandi nibashemererwa.<verse eid="1KI 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'ekitiinisa kya Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:18">Kut 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:31">Kur 23:31</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:4">Yos 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:26">2 Bus 9:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Sulemaani yaategyeka ensi z'abagabe zoona okuruga aha mugyera Furaati, okuhika aha nsi y'Abafilistia, n'aha mwatano gwa Misri; baaguma nibamutoijera, kandi nibamukorera ebiro byona ebi yaamazire aha ngoma. <verse eid="1KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Omutoijo gw'eby'okurya bya Sulemaani omu izooba rimwe gukaba guba encuro z'esaano y'obunono makumi ashatu, n'ez'endiijo saano makumi mukaaga, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />enkone z'ente ikumi, n'ezindi makumi abiri ezi baabaire baiha omu mariisizo, n'entaama igana, otabariiremu mpara, esirabo, engabi n'enkoko zigomokire. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:19">Kut 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:9">1 Bus 22:9</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akaba atwara ebyanga byona ebyabaire biri seenu y'omugyera Furaati, okuruga Tifusa, okuhika Gaaza, kandi n'abagabe boona abaabaire bari seenu y'ogwo mugyera; kandi akaba aine obusingye aha mbaju zoona. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:10">2 Sam 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:27">32:27</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:26">Ezk 28:26</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:4">Mik 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Abayuda n'Abaisraeli baaguma bari buhooro, buri muntu aha muzaabibu gwe, n'aha mutiini gwe, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba omu biro bya Sulemaani byona. <verse eid="1KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">1 Bag 10:26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani akaba aine emyanya ei embaraasi ze ezirikukurura ebigaari zirikuraaramu obukumi buna, kandi akaba aine abashaija abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Abo batware bakaba batoijera Sulemaani eby'okurya ahabwe n'ahabwa boona abaabaire bariira aha meeza ye, buri mutware okwezi kwe, hatarikugira kintu kyona ekyaburaho. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Buri mutware akaba areeta sayiri n'obunyaatsi bw'embaraasi n'obw'ezirikwiruka munonga, nk'oku yaabaire aragiirwa; abireeta omu mwanya ogu byabaire biba nibyetengwamu.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Ruhanga yaaha Sulemaani obwengye n'okwetegyereza ebitakareebwaga, kandi n'omutima ogwine okushoborokyerwa kwingi munonga nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:22">Byak 7:22</ref>. </char></note> butyo obwengye bwa Sulemaani bwakira obw'abantu b'oburugwa-izooba n'obwengye bwona obw'Abanyamisri. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Kandi akaba naakiza n'abandi boona obwengye, nka Esaani Omunyaezerahi, na Hemani, Katukooli na Darada beene Mahooli; eiziina rye ryarangaanwa omu mahanga goona agaabaire gamwehinguririize. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:1">Enf 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:9">Mub 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 1:1">Kyesh 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Akagunja enfumu enkumi ishatu, yaahimba n'ebyeshongoro rukumi na bitaano. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Akaba naamanya ebirikumera okwiha aha mwela ogw'omuri Lebanooni okuhika aha nyaweera erikumera aha rugo; kandi akaba naamanya enyamaishwa, n'enyonyi, n'ebirikugyendesa enda, n'eby'enyanja. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Bag 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:23">2 Bus 9:23</ref>. </char></note> Abantu bakaba baruga omu mahanga goona, baija kuhurira obwengye bwa Sulemaani, batumirwe abagabe b'omu nsi yoona, abaaherize kuhurira aha bwengye bwe.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okweteguurira okwombeka hekalu, akwataniise na Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 2:3">2 Bus 2:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro, ku yahuriire ngu beemekire Sulemaani kuba omugabe kuhungurira ishe, yaamutumaho abairu be; ahabw'okuba okwiha ira akaba ari munywani wa Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:11">2 Sam 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Sulemaani yaatuma ahari Hiraamu naagira ati: <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:3-16">2 Bus 2:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:8">1 Bus 22:8</ref>. </char></note> Noomanya ku tata Daudi atarabaasize kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga we enju ahabw'engamba z'abazigu abaabaire bamuri embaju zoona, okuhitsya obu MUKAMA yaabataire ahansi y'ebigyere bye. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:24">1 Bag 4:24</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye ampaire okuhuumura embaju zoona; tihakiriho bazigu nari akabi. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">2 Sam 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:6">1 Bus 28:6</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mmaririire kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye enju, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambiire tata Daudi, ati: Mutabani waawe, ou ndyemeka kukuhungurira, niwe aryombekyera eiziina ryangye enju. <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati ragiira bantemere emiti y'emyela omuri Lebanooni; baryakora n'abairu bangye; kandi ndyaguma nkuhe ebihembo by'abairu baawe nk'oku oringambira; ahabw'okuba noomanya ku hatariho n'omwe omuriitwe orikumanya kushara embaaho nk'Abasidoni.<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hiraamu, ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya Sulemaani, yaashemererwa munonga, yaagira ati: Eri izooba MUKAMA asiimwe, ahabw'okuha Daudi omwana w'obwengye kutegyeka eihanga eri erikuru. <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Hiraamu yaatuma ahari Sulemaani ati: Mpuriire ebi ontumireho byona; niinyija kukora byona eby'emyereezi n'eby'emiberooshi, nk'oku orikwenda. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:7">Ezr 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Abairu bangye baryagiiha Lebanooni, bagishuumye, bagihitsye aha nyanja, ngikomerane nk'ebibaya, ebone kuraba aha nyanja, ehikye omu mwanya ogu orindagiira; okwo ebe niyo yaakomororerwa, ogyakiire; kandi ku oriheereza ab'omu ka yangye eby'okurya, oryaba ohikize ebi ndikwenda. <verse eid="1KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Atyo Hiraamu yaatwekyera Sulemaani emyerezi n'emiberooshi ei yaabaire naayenda yoona; <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />na Sulemaani yaaha Hiraamu encuro z'engano obukumi bubiri n'entsimbo z'amajuta marungi makumi abiri ahabw'eka ye. Okwo nikwo Sulemaani yaagumire naamuha ebyo by'okurya buri mwaka. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA yaaha Sulemaani obwengye, nk'oku yaamuraganiise, yaagira obusingye na Hiraamu; bombi baaragaana endagaano y'okuhwerana.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:6">1 Bag 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:15">9:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Sulemaani yaatoorana abantu omuri Israeli yoona b'okuguma nibakora nibaihaihana; omubaro gwabo gukaba guri obukumi bushatu. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Yaaguma naayohereza kakumi-kakumi Lebanooni buri kwezi nibaihaihana; bamarayo okwezi kumwe, kandi ameezi abiri bagamara omuka; Adoniramu niwe yaabaire ari omukuru waabo. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:20-22">1 Bag 9:20-22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 2:18">2 Bus 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani akaba aine abeekorezi obukumi mushanju, n'abaabaire nibabaija amabaare omu nshozi obukumi munaana, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />otabariiremu bakuru b'emirimo enkumi ishatu na magana ashatu, abaabaire nibategyeka abakozi. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:7">1 Bag 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaabaragiira kuhigura amabaare mahango g'obuguzi bwingi, ngu babone kugabaija n'okugombekyesa omusingi gw'egyo nju. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 27:9">Ezk 27:9</ref>. </char></note> Batyo abombeki ba Sulemaani n'aba Hiraamu n'abantu ba Gebali bagabaija; bwanyima baatebeekanisa emiti n'ago mabaare kubyombekyesa egyo nju.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Emyombekyere ya hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Bus 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 3:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:47">Byak 7:47</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho emyaka magana ana na makumi munaana Abaisraeli barugire Misri, Sulemaani yaatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA, omu mwaka gwe gwa kana aherize kuza aha ngoma, omu kwezi kwa Ziivu, nikwo kwezi kwa kabiri. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:3">2 Bus 3:3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 3:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Enju ei omugabe Sulemaani yaayombekyeire MUKAMA, oburaingwa bwayo bukaba buri mikono makumi mukaaga, obukiika bwayo mikono makumi abiri, n'obwemi bwayo mikono makumi ashatu. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Ekisasi eky'omu maisho ga hekalu kikaba kiri mikono makumi abiri oburaingwa, nibwingana n'obukiika bwa hekalu, n'obuhango bwakyo omu maisho ga hekalu bukaba buri mikono ikumi. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Egyo nju yaagibaizira amadirisa g'embaaho zirabainemu ezitarikubaasa kwihwamu. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:16">1 Bag 6:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:49">7:49</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:6">8:6</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha bisiika by'egyo nju yaayombekyeraho ekindi kyombeko okwehinguririza ebisiika by'egyo nju, niyo hekalu n'ekishengye kyayo eky'Aharikwera munonga. Omuri ekyo kyombeko yaakoramu ebishengye okugyehinguririza. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Ebishengye by'ahansi obuhango bwabyo bikaba biri mikono etaano, ebya kaanyina-ibiri mikono mukaaga, n'ebya kaanyina-ishatu mikono mushanju; ahakuba okwehinguriririza emyanya y'emiraba kuhikiraho, ngu erekye kwoga omu bisiika by'enju.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Kandi egyo nju omu kwombekwa, ekombekwa amabaare agaagyereirwe omu iteerero ryago kare; n'ahabw'ekyo hekalu ku yaabaire neeyombekwa, hakaba hatahurirwa kirikugamba kyona, enyondo nari empango n'obu kyakuba ekintu kyona ekyetwa ekyoma ky'okukoresa.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Omuryango ogw'ebishengye bya kaanyina-ibiri gukaba guri aha rubaju rwa buryo; bakaba batembera aha matembero agarikugyenda nigeezinga okuhika omu bishengye bya kaanyina-ibiri, n'okwogaho gakahika omuri kaanyina-ishatu. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Okwo nikwo yaayombekire egyo nju, akagiheza, akagishakaaza emiraba n'embaaho eby'emyereezi; <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />kandi ebishengye by'ekyo kyombeko akabyombeka naabyegamiza hekalu, obwemi bwa buri kishengye bukaba buri mikono etaano, kandi ekyo kyombeko kikaba kiteerainwe n'enju ya hekalu n'emiraba y'emyereezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaizira Sulemaani, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Bag 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:4">9:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 22:10">1 Bus 22:10</ref>. </char></note> Eby'enju ei orikwombeka, ku origuma noogyendera omu biragiro ebi naataireho, waahikiiriza emigyenzo yangye, waayorobera ebi naaragiire byona, waabigyenderamu, obwo ndyahamya ekigambo kyangye, eki naagambiire sho Daudi; <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:8">Kur 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bir 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndyatuura omu bantu bangye Abaisraeli, ndekye kubatsigaho.<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Okwo nikwo Sulemaani yaayombekire egyo nju, akagiheza. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Bwanyima omunda ebisiika yaabishweka embaaho z'emyereezi, okuruga ahansi okuhika aha miraba y'etandaruha; kandi ahansi yaayariraho embaaho z'emiberooshi. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33">Kur 26:33</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 26:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:6">1 Bag 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:8">2 Bus 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:3">Heb 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Aha muheru gw'enju yaayombekaho ekisiika ky'embaaho z'emyereezi kya mikono makumi abiri okuruga ahansi okuhika aha miraba; ogwo mwanya gw'omwinziiro yaagugira omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda kuba Aharikwera munonga. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Kandi ekishengye ky'omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda kikaba kiri mikono makumi ana. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Ebisiika by'ekyo kishengye bikaba bishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi omunda, ezisharwirweho ebishushani by'ebisisi, n'eby'ebirabyo ebijanjamwire. Kyona kikaba kishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi, hataine ibaare ririkureebwa. <verse eid="1KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Ogwo Mwanya gurikwera ogw'omunda, ogwabaire guri aha muheru gw'egyo nju yaagushemeza kutamu eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Kandi ogwo mwanya gukaba guri mikono makumi abiri oburaingwa, makumi abiri obukiika, kandi makumi abiri obwemi; bwanyima yaagushweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe; kandi egyo zaabu yaagishweka n'eitambiro eryabaire rishwekirwe embaaho z'emyereezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Kandi Sulemaani yaashweka enju yoona omunda ezaabu; omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda yaacwekanisaho enjegyere z'ezaabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1">Kur 30:1</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Enju yoona yaagishweka ezaabu okuhitsya obu yaahweire; kandi n'eitambiro ry'omu Mwanya gurikwera ogw'omunda yaarishweka ezaabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:23-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 3:10-12">2 Bus 3:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:7-9">Kur 37:7-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omuri ogwo Mwanya gurikwera ogw'omunda yaakoramu ebishushani bya baakerubi bibiri omu mpimbi z'emizeituuni, buri kimwe mikono ikumi oburaingwa. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Oburaingwa bw'eipapa ry'ekishushani kya kerubi omwe bukaba buri mikono etaano, n'erindi etaano, okuruga aha ndiijo mikono ikumi. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Ekishushani kya kerubi owa kabiri oburaingwa bwakyo nabwo bukaba buri mikono ikumi; ebishushani byombi bikaba biine orugyero rumwe kandi nibishushana. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Oburaingwa bw'ekishushani kya kerubi bukaba buri mikono ikumi, kandi n'obw'ekindi nabwo butyo. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:20">Kur 25:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:9">37:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:7">1 Bag 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bishushani yaabita omu Mwanya gurikwera ogw'omunda aha muheru. Amapapa gaabyo gakaba gashashaanwire, eipapa rya kimwe nirihika aha kisiika ky'orubaju rumwe rw'enju, n'ery'ekindi nirihika aha rundi; agandi mapapa gaabyo nigabugaabuganira ahagati. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Ebyo bishushani bya baakerubi byombi yaabishweka ezaabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Kandi aha bisiika by'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda n'ogw'omumaisho yaasharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi, n'eby'emikindo n'eby'ebirabyo bijanjamwire. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Ahansi omu myanya egyo yombi yaahashweka ezaabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Aharikutaaha omu Mwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda yaataho enyigi z'embaaho z'emizeituuni; ekisasi n'ebiti by'ogwo muryango byaba kimwe kya kataano ky'ekyo kisiika. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Ezo nyigi zombi ez'emizeituuni yaazisharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi, n'eby'emikindo, n'eby'ebirabyo bijanjamwire, yaazishweka ezaabu, kandi ebyo bishushani bya baakerubi n'eby'emikindo yaabisiiga ezaabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Kandi aharikutaaha omuri hekalu yaataho ebiti by'emiryango eby'emizeituuni eby'embaju ina ezirikwingana; <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />orwigi rwaho yaarukora omu miberooshi, rwine embari ibiri; buri mbari erimu ebishate bibiri ebirikukubwa. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Ahari ezo mbari yaasharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi, n'eby'emikindo, n'eby'ebirabyo bijanjamwire, yaazisiiga ezaabu naagiinganisa omuri ebyo bicweka bisharwire. <verse eid="1KI 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Kandi orugo rw'ekibuga ky'omunda yaarwombekyesa amabaare gabaizire omu mishorongo eshatu, kandi omushorongo, gumwe guri ogw'emitambiko y'emyereezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:1">1 Bag 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kwa Ziivu okw'omwaka gwa kana nibwo baatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Omu kwezi kwa Buula nikwo kwezi kwa munaana okw'omwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe baagiheza n'emyanya yaayo yoona, nk'oku yaabaire eteekateekirwe kwombekwa. Yaamara emyaka mushanju naagyombeka.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okwombeka enju ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:1">1 Bag 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:10">9:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:1">2 Bus 8:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sulemaani akamara emyaka ikumi n'eshatu naayombeka enju ye, yaagiheza yoona. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17">1 Bag 10:17</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 10:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Yaayombeka enju y'ekibira kya Lebanooni, oburaingwa bwayo mikono igana, obukiika bwayo mikono makumi ataano, n'obwemi bwayo mikono makumi ashatu; kandi ekombekwa aha nyomyo z'emyereezi ezibyairwe omu mishorongo ena, etairweho emitambiko y'emyereezi; <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />ahaiguru y'egyo mitambiko makumi ana n'etaano, ikumi n'etaano omuri buri mushorongo, eyaabaire etairwe ahari ezo nyomyo, yaashwekaho embaaho z'emyereezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Yaakora emishorongo eshatu y'amadirisa gakurataine, buri dirisa nirireebana n'erindi. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Ebiti by'emiryango y'enyigi n'eby'amadirisa byona bikaba nibingana embaju zoona, kandi ago madirisa gari omu mishorongo eshatu, buri rimwe nirireebana n'erindi.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Kandi yaayombeka ekyombeko ky'enyomyo, oburaingwa bwakyo mikono makumi ataano n'obukiika bwakyo mikono makumi ashatu, n'omu maisho gaakyo yaataho ekisasi ky'enyomyo n'ekisanga ky'omwenda.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Kandi yaakora ekishengye ky'ekitebe ky'obugabe eky'okucweramu emanja, nikyo kishengye ky'eiramuriro; yaakyombekyesa embaaho z'emyereezi okuruga ahansi okuhika aha miraba.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 8:11">2 Bus 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:1">1 Bag 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enju ye, ei yaabaire naayenda kutaahamu, omu kibuga enyima y'ekyo kishengye, nayo ekaba ekozirwe etyo. Kandi Sulemaani akombekyera muhara wa Faraho ou yaabaire ashweire, endiijo nju erikushusha etyo.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Ago maju goona gakaba gombekyeise amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi, gabaizirwe nk'oku gaagyezirwe, kandi gashazirwe n'emisumeeno omunda n'enyima, okuruga aha musingi okuhika aha mushorongo ogw'aha mutwe, kandi okuruga omu kibuga ky'enju ya MUKAMA okuhika aha kibuga ekihango. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Amabaare g'omusingi gakaba gari ag'obuguzi bwingi, kandi mahango munonga, agamwe gari mikono ikumi n'agandi mikono munaana. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />N'ahaiguru yaataho amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi, gabaizirwe nk'oku gaagyezirwe, n'embaaho z'emyereezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">1 Bag 6:36</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kibuga kihango kikaba kyehinguririziibwe emishorongo eshatu y'amabaare gabaizire, n'omushorongo gumwe gw'emitambiko y'ebiti by'emyereezi, nk'oku baayombekire ekibuga ky'omunda eky'enju ya MUKAMA n'ekisasi kyayo.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe Sulemaani okukora omu nju ya MUKAMA eby'okugishemeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Omugabe yaatuma kweta Hiraamu okuruga Tuuro. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:3-5">Kur 31:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Bus 3:15-17</ref>. </char></note> Hiraamu ogwo akaba ari omwana w'omufaakazi ow'omu ruganda rwa Nafutaali, kwonka ishe ari owa Tuuro. Akaba ari omuheesi w'emiringa, owaabaire aine obwengye bwingi n'okwetegyereza, kandi omunyamwoga orikubaasa kuheesha ebintu byona eby'emiringa. Yaija aha mugabe Sulemaani, yaamukorera emirimo yoona ei yaabaire naayenda. <verse eid="1KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:17">2 Bag 25:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:8">1 Bus 18:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaaheesha enyomyo ibiri z'emiringa, buri emwe mikono ikumi na munaana oburaingwa, omuzimba gwayo mikono ikumi n'ebiri. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Kandi yaaheesha emitwe ebiri y'emiringa eyagiibwe kugita aha mitwe y'ezo nyomyo; oburaingwa bwa bwemi bw'omutwe gumwe bukaba buri mikono etaano, n'obw'ogundi nabwo butyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Ahari egyo mitwe y'ahaiguru y'enyomyo yaaheesheraho otugoye tw'emiringa otushobeekaine nk'akatimba, kandi yaahundaho emikuufu eri nk'ebitaako; aha mutwe gumwe yaataho mushanju n'aha gundi mushanju. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Kandi yaakora ebishushani by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga; yaabyehinguririza obwo butimba omu mishorongo ebiri, kuza ahari ogwo mutwe ogw'aha nyomyo; yaatwaza atyo n'ogw'aha ndiijo nyomyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Kandi emitwe ey'aha nyomyo z'ekisasi ekaba eri nk'ebirabyo by'emyangangye, oburaingwa bwayo mikono ena. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Emitwe egyo ekaba eri ahari ezo nyomyo, kandi ahaiguru y'engata ey'ahari buri nyomyo haihi n'obwo butimba; aho niho baahanikire ebishushani by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga omu mishorongo ebiri; ebyo bijuma bikaba biri magana abiri. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Atyo yaabyara ezo nyomyo omu maisho g'ekisasi kya hekalu, ey'aha rubaju rwa buryo yaagyeta Yakiini, n'ey'aha rwa bumosho yaagyeta Boazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Aha mutwe gw'ezo nyomyo baakoraho ebishushani by'ebirabyo by'emyangangye. Okwo nikwo omurimo gw'ezo nyomyo gwahweire.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Bus 4:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:17">2 Bag 16:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:13">25:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaakora ekitanka ky'amaizi ekikozirwe omu miringa eyagiibwe; kikaba kyezigoire, okuruga aha mugoma okuhika aha gundi mikono ikumi, obwemi bwakyo mikono etaano, kandi okwehinguririza omugoma gwakyo mikono makumi ashatu. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:18">1 Bag 6:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu bugyenyero bwakyo hakaba hakiikiizemu ebishushani by'ebisisi biri omu mishorongo ebiri, biheesherainwe nakyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Ekyo kitanka kikaba kiteekirwe aha bishushani by'enimi ikumi na ibiri, bishatu nibireeba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho, bishatu oburengyerwa-izooba, bishatu aha bwa-buryo, na bishatu aha burugwa-izooba; ekyo kitanka kiteekirwe ahaiguru yaabyo, biteeraine ebibunu. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Omubiri gwakyo gukaba guri ekita kimwe; eminwa yaakyo ekaba ekozirwe nk'ey'ekikopo, nari nk'ey'ekirabyo ky'emyangangye; nikigiibwamu encuro enkumi ibiri z'ebunyungu bihango.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:14">2 Bus 4:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaakora ebitebe ikumi omu miringa; ekitebe kimwe oburaingwa bwakyo mikono ena, obuhango bwakyo mikono ena, n'obwemi bwakyo mikono eshatu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Oku nikwo ebyo bitebe byabaire bikozirwe; bikaba biine ebiremu ebishensheize omu mbaaho zaabyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Ahari ebyo biremu ebishensheize omuri ezo mbaaho hakaba hasharwirweho ebishushani by'entare, n'eby'enimi, n'ebya baakerubi; kandi ahari ezo mbaaho, ahaiguru n'ahansi y'ebishushani by'entare n'enimi, hasharwirweho ebitaako. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Kandi buri kitebe kikaba kiine enziga ina z'emiringa, n'ebyoma ebirikuhindukirwaho ezo nziga; nabyo biri eby'emiringa; kandi aha nshonda zaakyo ina hariho ebirikuhamya ekinaabiro. Ebirikuhamya ebyo bikaba biheesherainwe n'ebitaako aha rubaju rwa buri kimwe. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Kandi ekyo kitebe kikaba kiine omugoma aha munwa gwakyo, obwemi bwagwo mikono gumwe n'ekicweka; ahari ogwo mugoma bakaba bagyenyireho; kandi ebiremu byabyo bikaba nibingana embaju zoona biteebumburukire. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Ezo nziga ina ziri ahansi y'ebyo biremu, n'ebirikuhindukirwaho enziga biheesherainwe n'ekyo kitebe; obwemi bw'enziga emwe bukaba buri mukono gumwe n'ekicweka. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Enziga ezo zikaba nizishusha nk'ez'ebigaari by'orugamba; ebyoma byazo ebi zirikwehinduriraho, n'ebyoma byazo by'enziga, n'enyomyo zaazo, n'emigongo yaazo, n'engata zaazo, byona bikozirwe omu miringa eyagiibwe. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Aha nshonda zoona ina eza buri kitebe hakaba hariho ebirikuhamya bina biheesherainwe nakyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Aha mutwe gwa buri kitebe hakaba hariho ekintu kyebumburikire, obwemi bwakyo ekicweka kya mukono gumwe, kandi enyomyo zaakyo n'ebiremu byakyo bikwataine. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Ahari ezo nyomyo n'ebyo biremu yaasharuraho ebishushani bya baakerubi n'eby'entare n'eby'emikindo, nk'omwanya gwa buri kimwe oku gwabaire guri, yaakitaho ekitaako okukyehinguririza. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Okwo nikwo yaakozire ebitebe ikumi; byona bikaba biheesirwe omu muringo gumwe, biri orugyero rumwe, kandi nibishushana.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:6">2 Bus 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:18">Kur 30:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaakora ebinaabiro ikumi by'emiringa; buri kinaabiro nikigiibwamu amaizi g'ebinyungu bihango makumi ana; buri kimwe kiine oburaingwa bwa mikono ena; byona ikumi buri kinaabiro kyagira ekitebe kyakyo. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Yaata ebitebe bitaano aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo obw'egyo nju, n'ebindi bitaano aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Kandi ekitanka yaakita aha nshonda y'orubaju rwa buryo orw'oburugwa-izooba bw'egyo nju.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:40-51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Bus 4:11—5:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:3">Kur 27:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Hiraamu yaakora ebinaabiro n'ebyoma by'okuyooza eiju, n'enyungu. Okwo nikwo Hiraamu yaaherize omurimo ogu yaabaire naakorera omugabe Sulemaani aha nju ya MUKAMA, <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:17-18">1 Bag 7:17-18</ref>. </char></note> enyomyo ibiri, enyabya ibiri, emitwe y'aha mitwe y'enyomyo, n'obutimba bw'okushweka enyabya ibiri ez'aha mitwe eyaabaire eri ahari ezo nyomyo, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:20">1 Bag 7:20</ref>. </char></note> n'ebishushani by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga eby'okuhunda aha butimba bwombi, emishorongo ebiri ahari buri katimba, kushweka ahari ezo nyabya eziri aha mitwe y'enyomyo, <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />ebitebe ikumi n'ebinaabiro ikumi ebyabaire biri ahari ebyo bitebe, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23">1 Bag 7:23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:25">25</ref>. </char></note> ekitanka kimwe n'ebishushani by'enimi ikumi na ibiri, ebyabaire biri ahansi yaakyo.<verse eid="1KI 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Kandi ezo nyungu n'ebyoma by'okuyoora eiju n'ebinaabiro, ebyo bintu byona ebi Hiraamu yaakoreire omugabe Sulemaani ahabw'enju ya MUKAMA, akabikora omu miringa ekuubirwe. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Omugabe akaba abiyagiza omu ruhita rwa Yorudani ahaabaire haine eitaka ry'eibumba ahagati ya Sukoosi na Zaretaani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:3">1 Bus 22:3</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 22:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Sulemaani tareeruhize kupima ebyo bintu byona, ahabw'okuba bikaba biri bingi munonga; n'ahabw'ekyo oburemeezi bw'emiringa tiburamanyirwe.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:48-49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 37:10-29">Kur 37:10-29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:30">Kur 25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:5-8">Lev 24:5-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Sulemaani yaakora ebintu byona eby'omu nju ya MUKAMA; eitambiro ry'ezaabu, emeeza y'ezaabu ey'emigaati y'okumurikwa, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />eby'okutaho amatabaaza by'ezaabu eshemeziibwe bitaano aha rubaju rwa buryo n'ebindi bitaano aha rwa bumosho omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda. Yaakora ebirabyo, amatabaaza n'empana eby'ezaabu; <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:16">1 Bag 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:3">Kur 27:3</ref>. </char></note> ebikopo, makansi, enyabya, esohaani z'obubaane, n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro by'ezaabu eshemeziibwe, epata z'enyigi ez'ekishengye ky'omunda eky'Omwanya ogurikwera munonga, kandi ez'enyigi z'ekishengye kya hekalu, zikaba ziri ez'ezaabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:11">2 Sam 8:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo omurimo gwona, ogu omugabe Sulemaani yaakozire aha nju ya MUKAMA gwahweire. Bwanyima Sulemaani yaataasyamu ebintu ebi Daudi ishe yaabaire ashoroire, efeeza, ezaabu, n'ebindi bintu; yaabita omu mabiikiro g'enju ya MUKAMA.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Sulemaani okutaasya eshanduukye omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 5:2-10">2 Bus 5:2-10</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 1:16">Kub 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 6:17">2 Sam 6:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaateeranira hamwe abakuru ba Israeli n'abakuru b'enganda boona, abakuru b'emiryango ya baishenkurubo, baateeranira Yerusaalemu omu maisho ga Sulemaani, kwinamura eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA nibagiiha omu rurembo rwa Daudi, Saayuuni. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:8-10">2 Bus 7:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23:24</ref>. </char></note> Abashaija boona Abaisraeli baateeranira ow'omugabe Sulemaani omu kwezi kwa Etanimu, nikwo kwezi kwa mushanju, baizire aha bugyenyi. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 4:15">Kub 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Abakuru ba Israeli boona baija, abanyamurwa baakiriza eshanduukye. <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:3">2 Bus 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Bainamura egyo shanduukye ya MUKAMA, n'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, n'ebintu byona ebirikwera ebyabaire biri omuri eryo ihema; abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baabitwara. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:13">2 Sam 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe Sulemaani n'eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli, abaabaire bateeraniire omu maisho ge, bakaba bari hamwe nawe omu maisho g'eshanduukye, nibatamba ebitambo by'entaama n'ente, ezitarikubaasa kubarwa ahabw'obwingi. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33">Kur 26:33</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 26:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 6:5">1 Bag 6:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abanyamurwa baareeta eshanduukye y'endagaano ya MUKAMA, baagita omu mwanya gwayo, omu mwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda omuri hekalu, aharikwetwa Aharikwera munonga, ahansi y'amapapa g'ebishushani bya baakerubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Ahabw'okuba ebyo bishushani bya baakerubi bikaba bishashaanwire amapapa gaabyo ahaiguru y'omwanya gw'okutamu eshanduukye; amapapa gaabyo gaashweka eshanduukye n'emigamba yaayo. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:13-15">Kur 25:13-15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi emigamba ekaba eri miraingwa munonga; n'ahabw'ekyo emitwe yaayo ekaba ereebekyera omu mwanya ogurikwera oguri omu maisho g'Omwanya ogurikwera ogw'omunda; kwonka ekaba etarikubaasa kureeberwa aheeru; kandi na hati ekiriyo. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:27">Kur 34:27</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:2">Bir 10:2</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 10:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:4">Heb 9:4</ref>. </char></note> Omuri egyo shanduukye tihaine kindi ekyabaire kibamu kureka ebishate by'amabaare bibiri, ebi Musa yaateereiremu aha rushozi Horebu, aha MUKAMA yaaraganiire n'Abaisraeli endagaano, nibaruga omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="1KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34">Kur 40:34</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 40:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Bus 5:13</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 5:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:3">Ezk 10:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 10:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abanyamurwa ku baarugire omu Mwanya ogurikwera, ekicu kyaijura enju ya MUKAMA, <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />batyo abanyamurwa tibaabaasa kwemereramu kuheereza ahabw'ekyo kicu; ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kya MUKAMA kikaba kiijwire enju ye.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12-50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 6:1-39">2 Bus 6:1-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaagira ati: MUKAMA akagira ati: Ndyaguma omu mwirima ndindindi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:11">Zab 18:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:5">2 Sam 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:14">Zab 132:14</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nkwombekyeire enju y'ekitiinisa, omwanya gwawe gw'okutuuramu ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="1KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Omugabe yaahindukira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli beemereire, yaabashabira omugisha, <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />naagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli asiimwe, owaahikiiriza n'omukono gwe eki yaaraganiise tata Daudi n'akanwa ke, naagira ati: <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Bir 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:1">1 Sam 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:4-16">2 Sam 7:4-16</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:25">25</ref>. </char></note> Okwiha obu naiha abantu bangye omuri Misri, tinkatooranaga rurembo kwombekamu enju, ngu eiziina ryangye ribe nimwo ryaguma; kureka nkatoorana Daudi kutegyeka abantu bangye Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Mbwenu kikaba kiri omu mutima gwa tata Daudi kwombekyera eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli enju. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Kwonka MUKAMA yaagira tata Daudi ati: Obaire okozire gye ahabw'enaama ei obaire oine kwombekyera eiziina ryangye enju. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Kwonka tiiwe oryombeka egyo nju, kureka mutabani waawe ou orizaara, niwe aryombekyera eiziina ryangye enju. <verse eid="1KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:5">1 Bus 28:5</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 28:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu MUKAMA yaahikiiriza eki yaaraganiise; ahabw'okuba naaza omu mwanya gwa tata Daudi, naagaruka aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli, nk'oku MUKAMA yaaraganiise; kandi nyombekire egi nju ahabw'eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Omwo nimwo ntaire omwanya ahabw'eshanduukye, erimu endagaano ya MUKAMA, ei yaaragaine na baatatenkuriitwe obu yaabaiha omu nsi ya Misri.<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:54">1 Bag 8:54</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 6:12">2 Bus 6:12</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 6:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 9:5">Ezr 9:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Sulemaani yaayemerera omu maisho g'eitambiro rya MUKAMA, eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli riri aho, yaimutsya emikono ye ahaiguru, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:11">Kur 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9">Bir 7:9</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 8:23">Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, tihariho ruhanga omu iguru ahaiguru n'omu nsi ahansi orikushushana naiwe, omu kurinda endagaano, n'omu kugirira embabazi abairu baawe abarikugyendera omu maisho gaawe n'emitima yaabo yoona; <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />kandi okahamya eki waaraganiise omwiru waawe tata Daudi; nk'oku waagambire n'akanwa kaawe, mbwenu waakihikiiriza n'omukono gwawe eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1 Bag 2:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati, MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, hamya eki waaraganiise omwiru waawe tata Daudi, noogira oti: Batabani baawe ku barigira emicwe mirungi, baagyendera omu maisho gangye nk'oku waabaire ogyenderamu, tiharibura muntu w'okushutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Mbwenu hati, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ninkweshengyereza ekigambo kyawe eki waagambiire omwiru waawe tata Daudi okihamye.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:49">Byak 7:49</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:29">17:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu kwo, n'eky'amazima Ruhanga aryatuura omu nsi? Reeba eiguru, nangwa n'eiguru eririkukirira kimwe kuba ahaiguru y'agandi torikubaasa kuhikamu; kaashwa egi nju ei nyombekire! <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Kwonka MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, ta omutima aha kushaba n'okweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe, noohurira okutaka kwe n'okushaba oku arikushaba omu maisho gaawe eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:16">1 Bag 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:3">9:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:15">2 Bus 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Obone kuguma otaire amaisho gaawe ahari egi nju nyomushana na nyekiro, omu mwanya ogu waagizire oti: Eiziina ryangye nimwo ririguma; obone kuguma noohurira okushaba oku omwiru waawe araagume naashaba naareeba omwanya ogu. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Kandi ogume ohurire okweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe n'okw'abantu baawe Abaisraeli, oku bariguma nibakushaba, nibareeba omwanya ogu; ogume ohurire ori omu iguru, omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu; kandi ku oraahurire, osaasire.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:11">Kur 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu ku arikora ekibi ahari mutaahi we, baamurahiza, nawe yaija yaarahirira omu maisho g'eitambiro ryawe omu nju egi, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:1">Bir 25:1</ref>. </char></note> ohurire ori omu iguru, ogire eki waakora, ocwere abairu baawe emanja, zisingye okozire kubi, aturwe okutahikiirira kwe, oihe orubanja ahari ohikiriire, omuzimuurire nk'okuhikiirira kwe oku kuri.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:9">Neh 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abantu baawe Abaisraeli ku baribingwa abazigu baabo ahabw'okukucumuraho, bwanyima baakuhindukira, baikiriza eiziina ryawe, baakushaba nibeeshengyerereza omu nju egi, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ohurire ori omu iguru ryawe, osaasire abantu baawe Abaisraeli ekibi kyabo, obagarure omu nsi ei waahaire baishenkurubo.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:17">Bir 11:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eiguru ku ririkingwa, enjura yaabura ahabw'abantu baawe kukucumuraho, bwanyima baashaba nibareeba omu mwanya ogu, baikiriza eiziina ryawe, baahinduka, baareka ekicumuro kyabo ahabw'okuhana kwawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:4">Zab 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:11">27:11</ref>. </char></note> ohurire ori omu iguru ryawe, osaasire abairu baawe ab'eihanga ryawe Israeli ekibi kyabo, obeegyese emitwarize mirungi ei bashemereire kugyenderamu; kandi ogwisize ensi yaawe enjura, ei waahaire abantu baawe kuba obuhunguzi.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:16">Lev 26:16</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:9">2 Bus 20:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi enjara ku eriteera omu nsi, nari orufu, nari okubabuka nari okusya-nyamwenga, nari enzigye, nari kanyanganga; nari abazigu okubagotera omuri ibara rurembo rwabo; nari ku haribaho kahumpuri nari endiijo ndwara yoona; <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />omuntu weena nari eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli baakushaba nibakweshengyereza, ibara muntu naamanya endwara y'omu mutima gwe, kandi aimukize emikono ye naagyorekyeza ei egi nju eri, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:7">1 Sam 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 28:9">1 Bus 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:24">Byak 1:24</ref>. </char></note> ohurire ori omu iguru omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu, osaasire, ogire eki waakora, oihure buri muntu, ou orikumanya omutima gwe, nk'oku emitwarize ye eri; ahabw'okuba niiwe wenka orikumanya emitima y'abantu boona, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:1">Bir 12:1</ref>. </char></note> ngu babone kukutiina ebiro byona ebi barimara omu nsi ei waahaire baatatenkuriitwe.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />Kandi n'omunyaihanga otari w'omu bantu baawe Israeli oriruga omu nsi ya hare, akaija ahabw'eiziina ryawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:32">2 Bus 6:32</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba tibaribura kuhurira aha iziina ryawe erikuru, n'aha mukono gwawe ogw'amaani kandi ogubangire, omuntu ogwo ku ariija yaashaba naareeba enju egi, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:24">Yos 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:15">Zab 102:15</ref>. </char></note> ohurire ori omu iguru omu mwanya gwawe ogu otuuramu, omumarire byona ebi ariba naakushaba, kibone kureetera amahanga goona ag'omu nsi kumanya eiziina ryawe n'okukutiina, nk'oku eihanga ryawe Israeli ririkukutiina, kandi bamanye egi nju ei nyombekire ku erikwetererwa eiziina ryawe.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />Abantu baawe ku barihurura nibaza aha rugamba kurwana n'abazigu baabo, omu muhanda gwona ogu oribatoozamu, baakushaba nibareeba ei oru rurembo oru waatooraine ruri, n'egi nu ei nyombekyeire eiziina ryawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />ohurire okushaba n'okweshengyereza kwabo ori omu iguru, obarwanirire. <verse eid="1KI 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:34">Lev 26:34</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:9">Enf 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:20">Mub 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:23">Rom 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:2">Yak 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:8">1 Yoh 1:8</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 1:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku barikucumuraho, (ahakuba tihariho muntu otacumura,) waabagirira ekiniga, waabahayo aha bazigu baabo, baatwarwa omu nsi y'abazigu baabo eya hare nari eya haihi, bari enkwatwa; <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:3">2 Bus 1:3</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku barihikayo, baayegarukamu, baayeteisa, baakweshengyererezayo, nibagira bati: Tukacumura, twashiisha, twakora eby'obugomi, <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:12-14">Yer 29:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:10">Dan 6:10</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:4">Yon 2:4</ref>. </char></note> baakugarukira n'omutima gwabo gwona n'amagara gaabo goona bakiri omu nsi y'abazigu baabo abaabatwaire omu bukwatwa, baakushaba nibareeba ei ensi ei waahaire baishenkurubo eri, n'orurembo oru waatooraine, n'egi nju ei nyombekyeire eiziina ryawe, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />ohurire okushaba kwabo n'okweshengyereza kwabo ori omu iguru ahu otuura, obamarire ebyabo, <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:46">Zab 106:46</ref>. </char></note> osaasire abantu baawe abo abaakucumwireho, obasaasire eby'okushiisha byabo byona ebi baakucumwireho, obahe okugirirwa embabazi abaabanyagire, babagirire esaasi, <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:20">Bir 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:29">9:29</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:10">Neh 1:10</ref>. </char></note> (ahabw'okuba n'abantu baawe kandi obuhunguzi bwawe, abu waihire omuri Misri omu iziiko ry'ebyoma).<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />Mbwenu ote amaisho gaawe aha kweshengyereza kw'omwiru waawe n'eihanga ryawe Israeli, obategye amatu omu bunaku bwona obu barikutakiriramu; <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kur 19:5</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba okabashoroora, waabataanisa n'amahanga goona ag'omu nsi, ngu babe obuhunguzi bwawe, Mukama RUHANGA, nk'oku waagambiire omu mwiru waawe Musa, obu waiha baatatenkuriitwe omuri Misri.<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:54: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 6:1">2 Bus 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:13">7:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sulemaani ku yaaherize okushaba okwo kwona, oku yaabaire naayeshengyereresa MUKAMA, yaimuka, yaaruga omu maisho g'eitambiro rya MUKAMA, ahu yaabaire atsimbire amaju aimukize emikono ahaiguru; <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />yaayemerera, yaashabira eihanga ryona ery'Abaisraeli omugisha, naagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:45">Yos 21:45</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:14">23:14</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA asiimwe, ohaire eihanga rye Israeli okuhuumura, nk'ebi yaaraganiise byona oku biri; omu bigambo byona ebirungi ebi yaaraganiise, naagambira omuri Musa, tihariho na kimwe ekirabuzire. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Bir 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yos 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:22">1 Sam 12:22</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu agume naitwe, nk'oku yaabaire aba na baatatenkuriitwe; ataritutsigaho, kandi atarituhemukaho; <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:36">Zab 119:36</ref>. </char></note> ayehunguurireho emitima yaitu, tugyendere omu mitwarize ye yoona, tworobere ebiragiro ebi yaataireho, n'emigyenzo ei yaaragiire baatatenkuriitwe. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Kandi ebi bigambo ebi naayeshengyereresa MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ndi omu maisho ge, agume abiijukye nyomushana na nyekiro, abone kuguma naashoboorora omwiru we n'eihanga rye ebiribabaho buri izooba, <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Bir 4:35</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:39">39</ref>. </char></note> amahanga goona ag'omu nsi gamanye MUKAMA ku niwe Ruhanga, ku hatariho ondiijo. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:4">1 Bag 11:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo emitima yaanyu ebe eshemeire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, mugyendere omu bi yaataireho, mworobere ebiragiro bye, nk'oku kiri eri izooba.<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Empongano ezi Sulemaani yaahongyeire MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:62-66: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Bus 7:4-10</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:16">Ezr 6:16</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 6:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe n'Abaisraeli boona baatambira ebitambo omu maisho ga MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Sulemaani yaahongyera MUKAMA empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye ente obukumi bubiri n'enkumi ibiri, n'entaama akasiriira n'obukumi bubiri. Okwo nikwo omugabe n'Abaisraeli boona baashoroire enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Kandi eryo izooba niryo omugabe yaashororoire ekibuga ky'ahagati eky'omu maisho g'enju ya MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba niho yaatambiire ekitambo ky'okwokyeza kimwe, n'empongano z'esaano, n'ebicweka by'ebishaju by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ahabw'okuba eitambiro ry'emiringa eryabaire riri omu maisho ga MUKAMA rikaba riri rikye, ritarikubaasa kuhikwaho bitambo by'okwotsya, n'empongano z'esaano, n'eby'ebishaju eby'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="1KI 8:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:5">Kub 34:5</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 34:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:2">1 Bag 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Sulemaani yaateekire obugyenyi omu bunaku obwo hamwe n'omutwe muhango gw'abantu aba Israeli yoona, abaabaire bateeraniire aho barugire omu nsi yoona okuruga ahu orikutaahira nooza Hamasi okuhika aha kagyera ka Misri, bakamarayo ebiro mushanju. Bwanyima baamara ebindi biro mushanju, byona byaba ikumi na bina. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Aha kiro kya munaana yaayohereza abantu; baamushabira omugisha, baataaha omu maka gaabo, bashemereirwe kandi bananukire ahabw'ebirungi byona ebi MUKAMA yaayorekire omwiru we Daudi n'abantu be Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okwehanangiriza Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Bus 7:11-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Sulemaani ku yaaherize kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA, n'ey'obugabe, n'ebindi byona ebi yaabaire naayenda kwombeka,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:1">1 Bag 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:19">9:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:6">2 Bus 8:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">1 Bag 3:5</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamweyoreka omurundi gwa kabiri, nk'oku yaamweyorekyeire Gibeoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:12">Bir 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:16">1 Bag 8:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 8:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Mpuriire okushaba kwawe n'okweshengyereza kwawe, ebi oreetsire omu maisho gangye; nshoroire egyo nju i oyombekire, naatamu eiziina ryangye ngu rigumemu ebiro byona; kandi amaisho gangye n'omutima gwangye biryagigumaho obutwire bwona. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:4">1 Bag 11:4</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naiwe ku origyendera omu maisho gangye nka sho Daudi, n'omutima gw'amazima kandi ogugororokire, nookora ebi naakuragiire byona, kandi nooyorobera ebiragiro byangye n'emigyenzo ei naabaragiire, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:12">1 Bag 6:12</ref>. </char></note> naanye ndyahamya ekitebe kyawe ky'obugabe, otegyeke Israeli ebiro byona, nk'oku naaraganiise sho Daudi, nimmugira nti: Toribura muntu w'okuza aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka iwe nari abaana baawe ku muriteishuka, mwandugaho, mwayanga kworobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebyatairweho ebi naataire omu maisho gaanyu, mwagyenda mwaheereza baaruhanga abandi, kandi mwabaramya, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:46">Bir 4:46</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:37">28:37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:23">2 Bag 17:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:21">25:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:14">Yer 7:14</ref>. </char></note> obwo ndyamaraho Abaisraeli omu nsi ei naabahaire; kandi n'enju ei naashorooreire eiziina ryangye ndyaginaga ngiihe omu maisho gangye; kandi Israeli eryaba eky'okucweraho enfumu n'ekigaaniizo omu mahanga goona. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:24-26">Bir 29:24-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:8">Yer 22:8</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:10-28">10-28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:1-18">2 Bus 8:1-18</ref>. </char></note> Egi nju eryaba orubungo; omuntu weena oriba naarabaho aryatangaara, ayeshaanye, naagira ati: Beitu shi MUKAMA akatura ki egi nsi n'egi nju? <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Bwanyima bagire bati: Ahabw'okuba bakatsigaho MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo owaihire baishenkurubo omu nsi ya Misri, baayehongyera baaruhanga abandi, baabaramya, kandi baabaheereza; nikyo MUKAMA abareeteireho obubi obu bwona.<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:37">1 Bag 6:37</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 6:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:1">7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha muheru gw'emyaka makumi abiri, ei Sulemaani yaayombekyeiremu ago maju gombi, eya MUKAMA n'ey'omugabe, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro owaabaire aha Sulemaani embaaho z'emyereezi n'ez'emiberooshi n'ezaabu, ebi yaabaire ayetenga byona, omugabe Sulemaani yaamuha endembo makumi abiri omu nsi ya Galilaaya. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Kwonka Hiraamu ku yaarugire Tuuro, yaija kureeba ezo ndembo zi Sulemaani amuhaire, tiyaazisiima. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Yaagira ati: Mwana wa tata, ezi ni ndembo ki ezi ompaire? Nikyo zaayeteirwe ensi ya Kabula n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Kandi Hiraamu akaba atwekyeire omugabe talanta z'ezaabu igana na makumi abiri. <verse eid="1KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:1">Yos 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 17:11">17:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:9">2 Sam 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 5:13">1 Bag 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Eki nikyo kyareeteire omugabe Sulemaani kukwata abantu b'okukora; okwombeka enju ya MUKAMA, eye ahabwe, Miilo, orugo rw'amabaare rwa Yerusaalemu, Hazoori, Megido, Gezeri, <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:10">Yos 16:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:1">1 Bag 3:1</ref>. </char></note> (Faraho omugabe wa Misri akaba ainamukire, akwatsire Gezeri, kandi agyokize; aitsire Abanyakanaani abaabaire batwire omuri orwo rurembo; bwanyima yaagiha muhara we muka Sulemaani kuba enshagarirano; atyo Sulemaani yaayombeka busya Gezeri) <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />na Besi-horoni eya ifo, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />na Baalasi na Tamari omu ihamba omu nsi ya Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">1 Bag 10:26</ref>. </char></note> endembo z'amabiikiro zoona ezi Sulemaani yaabaire aine n'ez'ebigaari bye, n'endembo z'engabo ze ezirikugyendera aha mbaraasi, n'ekindi kyona eki yaabaire ayenda kwombeka omuri Yerusaalemu, Lebanooni n'ensi zoona ezaabaire ziri omu bugabe bwe. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Abantu boona abaahonokire aha Baamori, Abahiiti, Abaperizi, Abahiivi, kandi n'Abayebusi abaabaire batari Baisraeli; <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:12">Yos 17:12</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 2:55-58">Ezr 2:55-58</ref>. </char></note> baijukuru baabo abaahonokireho omuri egyo nsi, abu Abaisraeli batarabaasize kucwekyerereza kimwe–abo nibo Sulemaani yaahindwire abahuuku b'okubakorera emirimo, bakaguma batyo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Abaisraeli bo Sulemaani tarabahindwire bahuuku, kureka bakaba abaserukare, abandi baaba abatware be, abandi abakuru b'amahe, abandi abakuru b'engabo, abandi abakuru b'ebigaari bye, n'abandi baaba engabo ze ezirikugyendera aha mbaraasi.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Abatware abakuru abaabaire nibareeberera omurimo gwa Sulemaani bakaba bari magana ataano na makumi ataano; abo nibo baabaire nibategyeka abantu abaabaire nibakora ogwo murimo. <verse eid="1KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:8">1 Bag 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:15">9:15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka muhara wa Faraho yaaruga omu rurembo rwa Daudi, yaataaha omu nju ye ei Sulemaani yaamwombekyeire; bwanyima Sulemaani yaayombeka Miilo. <verse eid="1KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Sulemaani yaaguma naatambira MUKAMA ebitambo by'okwotsya, n'eby'okusiima ahabw'obusingye kashatu omu mwaka, naabitambira aha itabiro eri yaayombekyeire MUKAMA, kandi naayoterera obubaane omu maisho ga MUKAMA. Atyo Sulemaani yaaheza enju.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Kandi omugabe Sulemaani yaakora eigana ry'emeeri, yaazikorera Ezioni-geberi, ahahereraine na Eloosi aha rubaju rw'Enyanja erikutukura omu nsi ya Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Bwanyima Hiraamu yaayohereza omuri ezo meeri abairu be, abarimbi abaabaire bamanyiire enyanja, kukwatanisa n'abairu ba Sulemaani; <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:4">1 Bus 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 28:16">Yob 28:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 45:9">Zab 45:9</ref>.</char></note> baaza Ofira, baihayo etalanta z'ezaabu magana ana na makumi abiri; baazireetera omugabe Sulemaani.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabekazi wa Sheeba okutaayaayira Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Bus 9:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:10">Zab 72:10</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 72:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:6">Isa 60:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12:42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabekazi wa Sheeba ku yaahuriire okurangaanwa kwa Sulemaani ahabw'eiziina rya MUKAMA, yaija kumubuuza ebibuuzo bigumire naamugyeza. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Yaija Yerusaalemu ashendekyereziibwe abantu baingi munonga, n'engamira ezeekoreire emigaju, ezaabu nyingi n'amabaare ag'obuguzi bwingi. Ku yaahikire ahari Sulemaani, yaamugambira kyona ekyabaire kimuri aha mutima. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Sulemaani yaagarukamu ebi yaamubuurize byona; tihariho kigambo na kimwe ekyayeshobire omugabe, eki ataramushobororeire. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Omugabekazi ku yaareebire obwengye bwona obwa Sulemaani, n'enju ei yaayombekire, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />eby'okurya by'aha meeza ye, emishutamire y'abagaragwa be, n'emiheerereze y'abaheereza be, n'ebijwaro byabo, n'abagabuzi be ba viinyo, n'emiinamukire ye naaza omu nju ya MUKAMA, omutima gwamuhwa omunda. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Yaagira omugabe ati: Ebigambo ebi naahuriire omu nsi yangye ebirikugamba aha by'emitwarize yaawe n'obwengye bwawe, bikaba biri eby'amazima; <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />kwonka tindabiikiriize okuhitsya obu nyeiziire, eriisho ryangye rikabyereebera; mbwenu naashanga batarangambiire n'obu kyakuba ekicweka kyabyo kimwe kya kabiri; kandi obwengye bwawe n'obugwa gye bwawe nibikira oku naabihuriire. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Abashaija baawe bahiiriirwe! N'abaheereza baawe aba bahiiriirwe, abeemerera obutoosha omu maisho gaawe, bakahurira obwengye bwawe! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:15">2 Sam 8:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 2:11">2 Bus 2:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, owakusiimire akakuta aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli, ahimbisibwe! MUKAMA ahabw'okukunda Israeli ebiro byona, nikyo yaakuteereireho kuba omugabe, ngu obone kucwa emanja z'oburyo omu kuhikiirira. <verse eid="1KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Bwanyima yaaha omugabe etalanta z'ezaabu igana na makumi abiri, emigaju mingi munonga, n'amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi; tihakagarukaga kwija endiijo migaju mingi nk'ei omugabekazi wa Sheeba yaahaire omugabe Sulemaani.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:27">1 Bag 9:27</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi n'eigana ry'emeeri za Hiraamu, ezaabaire zireeta ezaabu za Ofira, zikareeta n'embaaho z'alumuugi nyingi munonga, n'amabaare g'obuguzi bwingi. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Ezo mbaaho z'alumuugi omugabe yaazibaijamu enyomyo z'enju ya MUKAMA n'eye, kandi yaazibaijamu endongo n'enanga ahabw'abeeshongozi; tihariho biti by'alumuugi ebyagarukire kureetwa nari okureebwa ebiri nk'ebyo n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaaha omugabekazi wa Sheeba ebi yaabaire naayenda byona, n'ebi yaashabire byona, otabariiremu bi Sulemaani yaamuhaisize obufura nk'omugabe. Bwanyima yaakuba, yaagaruka omu nsi ye n'abagaragwa be.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obutungi bwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Bus 9:13-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ezaabu eyaabaire ereetwa owa Sulemaani buri mwaka ekaba eba etalanta magana mukaaga na makumi mukaaga na mukaaga, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />otabariiremu eyaabaire eruga omu bashuubuzi n'enshaagi ezaabaire ziruga omu batungi n'abagabe boona ba Buharabu, n'abategyeki b'omu nsi egyo. <verse eid="1KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Omugabe Sulemaani yaaheeshesa engabo z'ezaabu magana abiri, engabo emwe neeheeshwa omu zaabu ya shekeli magana mukaaga. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:2">1 Bag 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:26">14:26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaaheeshesa engabo nkye magana ashatu z'ezaabu; miina ishatu z'ezaabu niziheeshwamu engabo emwe; omugabe yaazita omu nju y'ekibira kya Lebanooni. <verse eid="1KI 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Kandi yaabaijesa ekitebe kihango ky'obugabe omu miino y'enjojo, yaakishweka ezaabu eshemeziibwe. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Ekyo kitebe ky'omugabe kikaba kiine amatembero mukaaga; kandi enyima yaakyo hariyo ekishushani ky'omutwe gw'enyana; ahari buri rubaju rw'ekyo kitebe hariho ah'okuta emikono, n'ebishushani bibiri by'entare, kimwe aha rubaju rumwe, n'ekindi aha rundi rubaju; <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />kandi n'ebindi bishushani by'entare ikumi na bibiri byemereire bibiri bibiri ahari buri itembero ahari ago matembero mukaaga, kimwe aha rubaju rumwe rwaryo, n'ekindi aha rundi. Omu bugabe obundi bwona tihariho kitebe ekyabaire nikishushana nakyo. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Eby'okunywaisa byona eby'omugabe Sulemaani bikaba biri eby'ezaabu, n'ebintu byona eby'omu nju y'ekibira kya Lebanooni bikaba biri eby'ezaabu eshemeziibwe; tihariho kintu na kimwe ekyabaire kikozirwe omu feeza, ahabw'okuba omu biro bya Sulemaani efeeza ekaba etarikubarwa kuba ekintu. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:4">Kut 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:48">1 Bag 22:48</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:10">Isa 60:10</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omugabe akaba aine eigana ry'emeeri aha nyanja ya Tarushiishi hamwe n'erya Hiraamu. Omurundi gumwe omu myaka eshatu, ago magana g'emeeri gakaba gaija gareetsire ezaabu, efeeza, emiino y'enjojo, enkobe na zaanyamunyonyi.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:12">1 Bag 3:12</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 3:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo omugabe Sulemaani yaakirize abagabe boona ab'omu nsi obutungi n'obwengye. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Abantu boona ab'omu nsi bakaba beetenga kureeba Sulemaani, ngu bahurire obwengye bwe, obu Ruhanga yaamuhaire. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Kandi weena owaabaire aija akaba areeta omutoijo, ebintu by'efeeza nari eby'ezaabu, ebijwaro, eby'okurwanisa, emigaju, embaraasi n'enyumbu; ebyo byona nikwo byabaire biija buri mwaka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:26">1 Bag 4:26</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:19">9:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:14-17">2 Bus 1:14-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Sulemaani akateeranira hamwe ebigaari n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi; ebigaari bye byaba rukumi na magana ana, n'abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi kakumi n'enkumi ibiri; yaabata omu ndembo z'ebigaari n'omuri Yerusaalemu ahu yaabaire ari. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Omugabe yaareetera Yerusaalemu okugira efeeza nyingi nk'amabaare, n'ebiti by'emyereezi byaba nk'emisikamoori y'omu mpita. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Bir 17:16</ref>. </char></note> Embaraasi ezi Sulemaani yaabaire aine bakaba baziiha omuri Misri; abashuubuzi b'omugabe bakaba bazigura omu busyo, buri busyo bwine obuguzi bwabwo. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Kandi ekigaari kikaba kiihwa Misri ahabwa shekeli z'efeeza magana mukaaga, n'embaraasi ahari igana na makumi ataano; kandi abashuubuzi ku baabaire bazireeta, baziguza abagabe boona ab'Abahiiti n'ab'Abasiria.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Okugwa kwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:17">Bir 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:26">Neh 13:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe Sulemaani yaakunda abakazi baingi b'endugamahanga; muhara wa Faraho, Abamoabukazi, Abaamonikazi, Abanyaedomukazi, Abasidonikazi n'Abahiitikazi, <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Kur 34:16</ref>. </char></note> abaarugire omu mahanga agu MUKAMA yaagambiire Abaisraeli naagira ati: Mutarishwererana nabo; ahakuba buzimazima baryahindura emitima yaanyu, mukuratire baaruhanga baabo. Kwonka Sulemaani ahabw'okubakunda yaababaho akaramata. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Akaba aine abakazi magana mushanju abanyiginyakazi, n'ebinyanshunju magana ashatu; abakazi be abo baahindura omutima gwe. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">1 Bag 8:61</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Sulemaani ku yaakuzire, baahindura omutima gwe, yaakuratira baaruhanga abandi; ahabw'okuba omutima gwe tigurabeereire kimwe gw'amazima ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga we nk'ogwa Daudi ishe. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:33">1 Bag 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:13">Bar 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:13">2 Bag 23:13</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Sulemaani akakuratira Ashitaroosi ruhanga-omukazi ow'Abasidoni, na Milikomu ekihagaro eky'Abaamoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Atyo Sulemaani yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, tiyaakuratirira kimwe MUKAMA nk'oku Daudi ishe yaakozire. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">2 Bag 23:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:2-4">Lev 20:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:43">Byak 7:43</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Sulemaani yaayombekyera Kemoshi ekihagaro kya Moabu, na Moleki ekihagaro ky'Abaamoni omwanya gw'okuramizamu aha kabungo k'oburugwa-izooba bwa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Kandi nikwo yaakoreire atyo abakazi be boona ab'endugamahanga, abaabaire bootera obubaane, bakatambira baaruhanga baabo.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhana Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:5">1 Bag 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:2">9:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:2">11:2</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:4">4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA yaagirira Sulemaani ekiniga, ahabw'okuba omutima gwe gukaba gurugire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, owaabaire amweyorekire kabiri, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:12">1 Bag 6:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:6">9:6</ref>. </char></note> kandi amuragiire naamwehanangiriza aha kintu eki, kutakuratira baaruhanga abandi; kwonka tiyaakora nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:31">1 Bag 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:15">12:15</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA yaagiriire Sulemaani ati: Nk'oku okozire eki, okiihire aha mutima, okanga kurinda endagaano n'ebyatairweho ebi naakuragiire, buzimazima niinyija kukwaka obugabe bwawe, mbuhe omugaragwa waawe. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Kwonka ahabwa sho Daudi tindikikora omu biro byawe, ndyabwaka mutabani waawe. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:20">1 Bag 12:20</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:15">2 Sam 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:33">Zab 89:33</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tindibumwaka bwona, kureka ndyamuhaho oruganda rumwe ahabw'omwiru wangye Daudi, n'ahabwa Yerusaalemu ei naayetooraniire.<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Sulemaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />MUKAMA yaimukiza Sulemaani omuzigu w'okumurwanisa, orikwetwa Hadadi Omunyaedomu, owaabaire ari ow'omu ruganda rw'obugabe bwa Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:14">2 Sam 8:14</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Daudi ku yaabaire ari Edomu, Yoabu owaabaire ari omukuru w'engabo yaimuka yaaza kuziika abaitsirwe, yaita oyetwa omushaija weena omuri Edomu; <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />(ahakuba Yoabu n'Abaisraeli boona bakamarayo ameezi mukaaga, okuhitsya obu yaacwekyereize oyetwa omushaija weena omuri Edomu) <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />kwonka Hadadi yaahungira Misri n'abamwe aha Banyaedomu abaabaire bari abairu ba ishe, we akiri muto. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Batyo baaruga Midiani, baahika Parani, baihayo abashaija, baabatwara, baaza Misri owa Faraho omugabe wa Misri, Faraho yaamuha enju, n'ab'okumutoijera eby'okurya, kandi yaamuha n'obutaka. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Hadadi ogwo yaagira obushongore bwingi ahari Faraho, ekyarugiremu yaamuhingira muramu we, murumuna wa Tapeneesi omukazi we nyeiteeka. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Murumuna wa Tapeneesi yaamuzaarira omwana w'omwojo orikwetwa Genubaasi, ou Tapeneesi yaacuukiize omu ka ya Faraho n'abaana be. <verse eid="1KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">1 Bag 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 2:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Hadadi ku yaabaire ari Misri, yaahurira ngu Daudi agwejegyeire, yaashaga baishenkuru, kandi ngu na Yoabu omukuru w'eihe afiire, Hadadi yaagira Faraho ati: Reka ngyende, ngarukye omu ihanga ryaitu. <verse eid="1KI 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Kwonka Faraho yaamubuuza at: Waaza kwenda kugaruka owaanyu mbuzire ki? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Tikiriho; kwonka fa okundeka ngyende.<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Kandi Ruhanga yaagaruka yaamwimukiza omuzigu orikwetwa Rezoni mwene Eliada, owaabaire acwire ahari mukama we Hadadezeeri omugabe wa Zooba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:3">2 Sam 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Daudi ku yaabaire aherize kwita aba Zooba, Rezoni yaateerana hamwe abantu, yaaba omwebembezi w'omutwe gw'abambuzi; baataha Damasiko, baatuurayo, bwanyima baamugira omugabe omuri Damasiko. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Yaaba omuzigu w'Abaisraeli ebiro byona ebya Sulemaani, naakora kubi nka Hadadi, naayangira kimwe Israeli, kandi naategyeka Siria.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeroboamu okuragurwaho ku aritwara obugabe bwa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:2">1 Bag 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:6">2 Bus 13:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yeroboamu mwene Nebati Omuefuraimu owa Zereda, omugaragwa wa Sulemaani, mwene Zerua omufaakazi, nawe yaimuka, yaarwanisa omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:24">1 Bag 9:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eki nikyo yaarwanisiize omugabe. Sulemaani akaba naayombeka Miilo, naahunduuza ekishenshero ky'orurembo rwa Daudi ishe. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Kandi Yeroboamu akaba ari omushaija orikwebaasa; n'ahabw'ekyo Sulemaani ku yaareebire ogwo mutsigazi ari omukozi, yaamuha obukuru bw'okureeberera abapakasi boona ab'omu muryango gwa Yosefu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:15">1 Bag 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:29">15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:29">2 Bus 9:29</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo, Yeroboamu ku yaabaire naaruga Yerusaalemu, nabi Ahiya owa Shiilo yaamubugana. Obwo Ahiya akaba ajwaire omwenda musya; bari bombi omu bwerere. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:27">1 Sam 15:27</ref>. </char></note> Ahiya yaakwata ekyo kijwaro kye, yaakitaaguramu emitanda ikumi n'ebiri. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Yaagira Yeroboamu ati: Yetwarire emitanda ikumi; ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli nikwo arikugira ati: Reeba, niinyija kwaka Sulemaani obugabe, iwe nkuhe enganda ikumi; <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:21">1 Bag 12:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:21">14:21</ref>. </char></note> kwonka naija kuguma n'oruganda rumwe ahabw'omwiru wangye Daudi, n'ahabwa Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru naatooraine omu nganda zoona eza Israeli; <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />ahabw'okuba antsigireho, yaaramya Ashitaroosi ruhanga-omukazi owa Sidoni, na Kemoshi ruhanga wa Moabu, na Milikomu ruhanga w'Abaamoni; kandi yaayanga kugyendera omu mihanda yangye n'okukora ebihikire omu maisho gangye, n'okworobera ebyatairweho n'emigyenzo ei naaragiire, nk'oku Daudi ishe yaabaire naatwaza. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Kwonka tindimwaka bugabe bwona, kureka ndyamureka agume ari omutegyeki omu biro bye byona, ahabwa Daudi omwiru wangye ou naatooraine akoorobera ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naataireho. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:16">1 Bag 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Omwana we niwe ndyaka obugabe, nkakuha enganda ikumi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:17">2 Sam 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:4">1 Bag 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omwana we ndyamuha oruganda rumwe, ngu Daudi omwiru wangye agume n'etabaaza obutoosha omu maisho gangye omuri Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru naatooraine kugumyamu eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Kandi ndyakutwara otegyekye nk'oku orikwenda kwona, obe omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11">2 Sam 7:11</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:35">1 Sam 2:35</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku orihurira ebi ndikukuragiira, waagyendera omu mihanda yangye, waakora ebihikire omu maisho gangye, nooyorobera ebi naataireho n'ebiragiro byangye, nk'omwiru wangye Daudi oku yaabaire atwaza, ndyaguma naiwe, nkwombekyere enju ehamire, nk'ei naayombekyeire Daudi; kandi nkuhe Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Kandi ahabw'ekyo ndyabonabonesa baijukuru ba Daudi, kwonka ti biro byona. <verse eid="1KI 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:25">1 Bag 14:25</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kyareetera Sulemaani kwenda kwita Yeroboamu; kwonka Yeroboamu yaimuka, yaahungira Misri owa Shishaki omugabe wa Misri, yaagumayo okuhitsya obu Sulemaani yaafiire.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:41-43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Bus 9:29-31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Sulemaani n'ebi yaakozire byona, n'obwengye bwe, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyakozirwe Sulemaani? <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Kandi omwanya gwona ogu Sulemaani yaamazire aha ngoma Yerusaalemu, naategyeka Israeli yoona, gukahika emyaka makumi ana. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:7">Mat 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Sulemaani yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi ishe, Rehoboamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Obugabe bwa Israeli okucuubwamu habiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Bus 10:1-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Rehoboamu yaaza Shekemu, ahakuba Abaisraeli boona niyo baabaire bagiire kumwemeka. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:26">1 Bag 11:26</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:40">40</ref>. </char></note> Omu bunaku obwo Yeroboamu mwene Nebati akaba akiri Misri, ei yaabaire ahungiire omugabe Sulemaani. Ku yaakihuriire, yaarugayo. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Baamutumaho ab'okumweta; atyo Yeroboamu n'omutwe gw'Abaisraeli boona baija, baagira Rehoboamu bati: <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:11-18">1 Sam 8:11-18</ref>. </char></note> Sho akongyera oburemeezi aha kutegyekwa kwaitu. Mbwenu otutuubize aha mirimo erikurusya ei sho yaabaire naatukoresa, n'aha buremeezi bw'okutegyeka kwe, naitwe nitwija kukuheereza. <verse eid="1KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Mbwenu mugarukyeyo, mumareyo kashatu; haza mugarukye. Batyo abantu baayaabuuka, baagyenda.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaaza omu naama n'abagurusi abaabaire batabaarira Sulemaani ishe akiriho, yaabagira ati: Nimumpa bwengye ki okugarukamu abo bashaija? <verse eid="1KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Baamugira bati: ku oraikirize kuba omuheereza w'eri ihanga eri izooba, waabaheereza, kandi waabagarukamu ebigambo ebirikubagwisa gye, obwo nibwo bariba abairu baawe ebiro byona. <verse eid="1KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Kwonka we yaayanga enaama ei abo bagurusi baamuha, bwanyima yaaza omu naama n'abatsigazi abaanyeetsire nawe, kandi abaabaire nibamutabaarira. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Yaababuuza ati: Nimumpa bwengye ki okugarukamu abo bantu abangizire ngu mbatuubize aha buremeezi bw'obutegyeki obu tata yaabataireho? <verse eid="1KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Abo batsigazi abaanyeetsire nawe baamugira bati: Oku nikwo oraagarukyemu abantu abakushabire nibagira bati: Sho akongyera oburemeezi aha kutegyekwa kwaitu; mbwenu iwe otutuubizeho; obagire oti: Akakumu kangye akahera nikakira obuhango enyugunyu ya tata. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Mbwenu nk'oku tata yaabeekoreize omugamba guremeire, nyowe niinyija kukizaho. Tata akaba abateeza enkoba, nyowe niinyija kubateeza <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Skorupio n'akakooko akarikutoneza omukira. </char></note>skorupio.<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Aha kiro kya kashatu Yeroboamu yaija n'abantu boona aha mugabe Rehoboamu, nk'oku yaabagizire ati: Mugarukye aha kiro kya kashatu. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Omugabe yaabagarukamu n'amaani, naayanga obwengye obu abagurusi babaire bamuhaire; <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />yaabagarukamu nk'obwengye bw'abatsigazi obu bamuhaire oku bubaire buri, ati: Tata akaba abeekoreza omugamba guremeire, kwonka nyowe niinyija kukizaho. Akaba abateeza enkoba, kwonka nyowe niinyija kubateeza skorupio.<verse eid="1KI 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:11">1 Bag 11:11</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:31">31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo omugabe tiyaabahurira, ahabw'okuba kikaba kirugire ahari MUKAMA, ngu ahikiirize ekigambo eki yaagambiire Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, naakirabya omuri Ahiya owa Shiilo. <verse eid="1KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">2 Sam 20:1</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli boona ku baareebire omugabe yaayanga kubahurira, baamugira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Twine kakwate ki na Daudi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Titwine buhunguzi omuri mwene Yese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimugarukye omu mahema gaanyu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Naimwe aba Daudi, mugume mwemarire ebyanyu n'oruganda rwanyu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Batyo Abaisraeli baagaruka omu maka gaabo. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13">1 Bag 11:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Rehoboamu yaagumizamu naategyeka Abaisraeli abaabaire batwire omu ndembo za Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">1 Bag 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 5:14">5:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaatuma Adoramu owaabaire ari omukuru w'abakozi b'emirimo y'okuhatwa; Abaisraeli boona baamuteera amabaare, yaafa. Omugabe Rehoboamu ku yaabihuriire, ahonaaho yaaza omu kigaari kye kuhungira Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:21">2 Bag 17:21</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baagomeire enju ya Daudi n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="1KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13">1 Bag 11:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:32">32</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abaisraeli boona ku baahuriire ngu Yeroboamu agarukire, baamutumaho ab'okumweta ngu aije omu ishengyero, bamwemekye kuba omugabe wa Israeli yoona. Tihaabaho n'omwe owaagaruka kukuratira enju ya Daudi, kureka oruganda rwa Yuda rwonka.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:21-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Bus 11:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rehoboamu ku yaahikire Yerusaalemu, yaateeranira hamwe enju ya Yuda yoona n'oruganda rwa Benyamiini, n'abashaija emanzi abatoorainwe akasiriira n'obukumi munaana ab'okurwanisa enju ya Israeli, ngu bagarurire Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani obugabe. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:5">2 Bus 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 12:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 12:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ekigambo kya Ruhanga kyaija ahari Shemaaya, omushaija wa Ruhanga, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />Gambira Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani omugabe wa Yuda kandi n'abantu boona ab'enju ya Yuda n'eya Benyamiini, n'abandi boona, oti: <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mutahurura, n'obu kwakuba okurwanisa beene waanyu Abaisraeli. Buri muntu agarukye omu ka ye, ahakuba ekintu eki niinye kirugireho. Batyo baahurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA, baagaruka omuka, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi kya Yeroboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 8:17">Bar 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 9:45">9:45</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yeroboamu yaayombeka Shekemu omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Efuraimu, yaatuurayo; ku haahingwireho ebiro, yaafurukayo, yaazingura Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Bwanyima Yeroboamu yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: Nimmanya ngu hati obugabe nibwija kugaruka omu nju ya Daudi; <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:6">6</ref>. </char></note> abantu aba ku baraagume nibainamuka Yerusaalemu kutambirayo ebitambo omu nju ya MUKAMA, emitima yaabo eryagarukira mukama waabo, Rehoboamu omugabe wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Kur 32:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 32:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:9">1 Bag 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 10:29">2 Bag 10:29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:16">17:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:15">2 Bus 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:8">13:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:5">Hos 8:5</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 8:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 10:5">10:5</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:2">13:2</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe yaagira enaama y'okukora ebishushani bibiri by'enyana omu zaabu. Yaagira abantu ati: Nikiija kubarusya okuguma nimwinamuka Yerusaalemu. Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, nimureebe baaruhanga baanyu abaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Ekimwe yaakita omuri Beseeli n'ekindi yaakita Daani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:34">1 Bag 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:21">2 Bag 17:21</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo eki yaakozire kyaba ekibi; ahakuba abantu bakaba baza kuramya eky'omuri Beseeli, n'ekindi bakishanga omuri Daani. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:32">1 Bag 13:32</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 13:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:32">2 Bag 17:32</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:14">2 Bus 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 11:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 13:9">13:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaayombeka amaju omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, yaagaruka yaataho abanyamurwa naabaiha omu bandi bantu, abatari b'omu Baleevi. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33">Lev 23:33</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 29:12">Kub 29:12</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:2">1 Bag 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:13">Amo 7:13</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano omu kwezi kwa munaana Yeroboamu yaataho obugyenyi, nk'obw'omuri Yuda; yaatambira ebitambo aha itambiro; kandi yaagira atyo n'omuri Beseeli, naatambira enyana ezi yaakozire ebitambo. Bwanyima yaata abanyamurwa omu myanya egyo emikuru ei yaakozire kuramizamu. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:1">1 Bag 13:1</ref>. </char></note> Yainamuka aha itambiro eri yaabaire akozire omuri Beseeli aha kiro kya ikumi na bitaano omu kwezi kwa munaana, omu kwezi oku yaayeteereireho; yaaragiira ku habaho obugyenyi ahabw'Abaisraeli, kandi yainamuka aha itambiro kwotera obubaane.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Okukyeenwa kw'eitambiro rya Yeroboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:33">1 Bag 12:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi reeba, haija omushaija wa Ruhanga naaruga omuri Yuda areetsirwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga omuri Beseeli. Obwo Yeroboamu akaba ayemereire aha rubaju rw'eitambiro kwotera obubaane. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15">2 Bag 23:15</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija yaakyeena eitambiro n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA naagira ati: Iwe itambiro 'we, itambiro, oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, omwana w'omwojo orikwetwa Yosia aryazaarirwa enju ya Daudi; bwanyima aryakutambiraho abanyamurwa b'emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, abakwotereraho obubaane, kandi akwokyezeho n'amagufa g'abantu. <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Ahari eryo izooba yaayoreka akamanyiso, naagira ati: Aka niko kamanyiso aku MUKAMA yaagamba, naagira ati: Reeba, eri itambiro niriija kushatuka, n'eiju ryaho ryatikye. <verse eid="1KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Omugabe Yeroboamu ku yahuriire ebigambo by'ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga, ebi yaakyeena eitambiro ry'omuri Beseeli, yaamworekyeza omukono ari aha itambiro naagira ati: Mumukwate. Omukono ogu yaabaire amworekyeize gwayomerayo, tiyaabaasa kugugarura. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Eitambiro ryashatuka, n'eiju ryayatika, nk'akamanyiso aku omushaija wa Ruhanga yaayorekire ahabw'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kaabaire kari. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:8">Kur 8:8</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 9:28">9:28</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 10:17">10:17</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:7">Kub 21:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:24">Byak 8:24</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagambira ogwo muntu wa Ruhanga ati: Yeshengyereza MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe hati, onshabire, omukono gwangye gukire. Atyo omushaija wa Ruhanga yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA, omukono gw'omugabe gwakira, gwaba nk'oku gushangirwe guri. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:15">2 Bag 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga ati: Ija tugyendane omuka, oruhuukyeho, kandi niinyija kukuha ebihembo. <verse eid="1KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Kub 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:13">24:13</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga yaamugarukamu ati: N'obu waakumpa ekicweka ky'enju yaawe, tindikwija kutaahamu naiwe. Kandi tindikwija kurya eby'okurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi omu mwanya ogu; <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />ahabw'okuba nikwo ekigambo kya MUKAMA kindagiire, nikigira kiti: Otariryayo eky'okurya, otarinywayo amaizi, n'obu kwakuba okugaruka omuhanda ogu oreetsirwe. <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Atyo yaatoora ogundi muhanda, tiyaagaruka muhanda ogumureetsire naaza Beseeli.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nabi okugomera ekiragiro kya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Omu bunaku obwo hakaba hariho nabi omugurusi atwire Beseeli. Abatabani baija, baamugambira byona ebi ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga yaakora Beseeli eryo izooba; kandi n'ebigambo ebi yaagambira omugabe, baabigambira ishebo. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Ishebo yaababuuza ati: yaatoora muhanda ki? Abatabani baamworeka omuhanda ogu ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga orugire omuri Yuda yaatoora. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Yaagira abatabani ati: Nimuntandiikire endogoya. Batyo baamutandiikira endogoya, yaagitemba. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Yaakurata ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga, yaamushanga ashutami ahansi y'omwela, yaamubuuza ati: Niiwe mushaija wa Ruhanga orugire omuri Yuda? Yaamugarukamu ati: Niinye. <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Bwanyima yaamugira ati: Ija tugyendane omuka, orye ak'okurya. <verse eid="1KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Tindikwikirizibwa kugarukayo naiwe, nari okutaaha omuka naiwe, n'obu kwakuba okurya eby'okurya nari okunywa amaizi naiwe omuri ogu mwanya; <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />ahabw'okuba nikwo ekigambo kya MUKAMA kindagiire nikigira kiti: Otariryayo eby'okurya, otarinywayo amaizi, n'obu kwakuba okugaruka omuhanda ogu oreetsirwe. <verse eid="1KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Onu yaamugira ati: Naanye ndi nabi nkaiwe, kandi maraika otumirwe ekigambo kya MUKAMA yangira ati: Irooko omugarure omu ka yaawe, arye ak'okurya, kandi anywe otwizi. Kwonka akaba naamubeiha. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Atyo yaagaruka nawe omuka, baarya eby'okurya omu ka ye, kandi baanywa n'amaizi.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Ku baabaire bakiri aha meeza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari nabi ogwo owaamugarura; <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />yaagambira ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga orugire omuri Yuda n'eiraka rihango, ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okugomera ekigambo kya MUKAMA, kandi n'okutoorobera kiragiro eki MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akuragiire, <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />okagaruka, okarya eby'okurya, okanywa amaizi omu mwanya ogu akuzibiire naagira ati: Otariryamu eby'okurya n'obu kwakuba okunywamu amaizi, n'ahabw'ekyo omutumbi gwawe tigurihika ha kituuro kya baashwenkuru. <verse eid="1KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Nabi ogwo omugurusi, ku yaaherize kurya eby'okurya n'okunywa, yaatandiikira nabi ogwo ou yaagarura endogoya. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:36">1 Bag 20:36</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakigyenda, entare yaamubugana omu muhanda, yaamwita; omutumbi gwe gwagangarama omu muhanda, endogoya yaagwemerera aha rubaju, n'entare nayo yaayemereraho. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Kandi reeba, abantu abaarabireho baareeba omutumbi gugangarami omu muhanda, entare egwemereire aha rubaju; baija, baakigamba omu rurembo omu ogwo mugurusi nabi yaabaire atwire.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Nabi ogwo owaamugaruriire omu muhanda ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: N'omushaija wa Ruhanga, owaagomera ekigambo kya MUKAMA; nikyo MUKAMA yaamuriisiza entare, ekamutaagataagura, ekamwita, nk'ekigambo eki MUKAMA amugambiire oku kiri. <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Yaagira abatabani ati: Muntandiikire endogoya. Nabo baagitandiika. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Yaagyenda, yaashanga omutumbi gugangarami omu muhanda, endogoya n'entare bigwemereire aha rubaju, entare etaguriire n'obu kwakuba okutaagataagura endogoya. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Nabi ogwo yaihaho omutumbi gw'omushaija wa Ruhanga, yaaguta aha ndogoya, yaagugarura omu rurembo kumucurira n'okumuziika. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ogwo mutumbi yaaguziika omu kituuro kye, baamucurira, buri omwe naagira ati: Ai bambe, mwene tata! <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:17">2 Bag 23:17</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 23:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Nabi ogwo ku yaaherize kumuziika, yaagira abatabani ati: Ku ndifa, munziikye omu kituuro ekyaziikwamu omushaija wa Ruhanga, amagufa gangye gahereere age; <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:24">1 Bag 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:16-19">2 Bag 23:16-19</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki agambire naakyena eitambiro ery'omuri Beseeli n'amaju goona ag'omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, ey'omu ndembo za Samaria, kiryahikiirira buzima.<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 17:5">Bar 17:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ekyo hoona nabwo Yeroboamu tiyaahinduka kuruga omu muhanda gwe omubi, kureka yaataho abanyamurwa ahabw'egyo myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, naabaiha omu bandi bantu boona; ibara muntu owaabaire akunda, amushoroora kuba omunyamurwa w'egyo myanya. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:30">1 Bag 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:29">15:29</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo eki yaakozire kyaba ekibi aha nju ye ky'okugimaraho n'okugihwerekyereza ekahwaho.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Nabi Ahiya okuragura ebiriba aha nju ya Yeroboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Omu biro ebyo Abiya mwene Yeroboamu akarwara. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Yos 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:29-31">1 Bag 11:29-31</ref>. </char></note> Yeroboamu yaagira omukazi we ati: Imuka oyehindure, orekye kumanywa ku ori omukazi wangye, oze Shiilo. Noomanya nabi Ahiya owandagwireho ngu ndyaba omugabe w'eri ihanga, ku niyo ari. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Kandi otware emigaati, n'otukeeki, n'akanyungu k'obwoki, omuhikyeho; naija kukugambira oku ogu mwana araabe.<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Muka Yeroboamu yaatwaza atyo; yaimuka, yaaza Shiilo, yaahika aha nju ya Ahiya. Kandi Ahiya akaba atakibaasa kuhweza, ahakuba amaisho ge gakaba gaagiirwemu oruho ahabw'obukuru. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />MUKAMA yaagira Ahiya ati: Reeba, muka Yeroboamu naija kukwebuuzaho eby'omutabani, ahakuba arwaire. Ku araataahemu, omugambire oti n'oti; ahabw'okuba naija kwehindura ondiijo mukazi. <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo Ahiya ku yaahuriire emitsindo ye naakiija yaahika aha rwigi, yaagira ati: Iwe muka Yeroboamu, taaha omu nju; nooyehindurira ki ondiijo? Manya nkutumirweho ebigambo bibi. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:2">1 Bag 16:2</ref>. </char></note> Irooko ogambire Yeroboamu oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba, naagira ati: Nkakwiha omu bandi bantu, naakukuza, naakugira omwebembezi w'eihanga ryangye Israeli; <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:4">1 Bag 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:31">11:31</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:33">33</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:38">38</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:5">15:5</ref>. </char></note> naayaka enju ya Daudi obugabe, naabukuha; kwonka iwe tiwambeera nk'omwiru wangye Daudi, owaabaire ayorobera ebiragiro byangye, nankuratira n'omutima gwe gwona, naakora ebi ndikusiima byonka, <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:17">Kur 34:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 11:15">2 Bus 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:26">Neh 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:35">Ezk 23:35</ref>. </char></note> kureka waakora kubi okukira abaakubandiize boona, waagyenda, waayekorera baaruhanga abandi n'ebishushani ebiyagiibwe, wangwisa kubi, wannaga enyima. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:3">1 Bag 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:21">21:21</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo niinyija kureeta akabi aha nju ya Yeroboamu, mmumareho oyetwa omushaija weena, omuhuuku n'ow'obusingye omu Baisraeli, mmarireho kimwe enju ya Yeroboamu, nk'oku omuntu aheha amazi, akamariraho kimwe. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:4">1 Bag 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:24">21:24</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu wa Yeroboamu weena, origwa omu rurembo, aryariibwa embwa; kandi origwa omu ishwa, aryariibwa amahungu; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA niwe akigambire. <verse eid="1KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo imuka, oyetaahire. Kwonka ebigyere byawe ku biraaribate biti omu rurembo, omwana naafa. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:12">2 Bus 12:12</ref>. </char></note> Abaisraeli boona nibaija kumucurira, bamuziikye; ogwo niwe wenka omu ba Yeroboamu oriziikwa omu kituuro, ahabw'okuba omu nju ya Yeroboamu niwe wenka oreebirwemu ekirungi ekirikusiimwa MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:27-29">1 Bag 15:27-29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA aryayeimukiza omugabe okutegyeka Israeli; niwe arimaraho enju ya Yeroboamu aha izooba eryo. Hariho obundi bunaku? Tibwo obu? <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:13">Kur 34:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:3">Bir 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:28">29:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:15">Yos 23:15</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 23:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba MUKAMA aryateera Abaisraeli, babe nk'ekifunjo ekirikutengyetsibwa amaizi, abarandure omuri egi nsi nungi ei yaahaire baishenkurubo, abataataanisize seeri y'omugyera Furaati, ahabw'okuba bakeekorera Asherimu, baagwisa kubi MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:30">1 Bag 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:34">13:34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:2">16:2</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Aryatsigaho Israeli, abature ebibi bya Yeroboamu ebi yaakozire, n'ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli.<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Atyo muka Yeroboamu yaimuka, yaagyenda, yaagaruka Tiruza. Ku yaahikire ati aha muryango gw'enju, omwana yaakaba. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Abaisraeli boona baamuziika, baamucurira nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaarabize omu mwiru we nabi Ahiya oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="1KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:2-20">2 Bus 13:2-20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebindi byona ebi Yeroboamu yaakozire, oku yaarwaine engamba, n'oku yaategyekire, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Emyaka ei Yeroboamu yaamazire aha ngoma ekaba makumi abiri n'ebiri; yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, omutabani Nadabu yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyabaireho omu busingye bwa Rehoboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:32">1 Bag 11:32</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:13">2 Bus 12:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani akategyekyera omuri Yuda. Obu yaaza aha ngoma, akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ana na gumwe, yaamara emyaka ikumi na mushanju naategyeka omuri Yerusaalemu, orurembo oru MUKAMA yaatooraine omu nganda za Israeli zoona, ngu abe nimwo yaata eiziina rye. Kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Naama Omwamonikazi. <verse eid="1KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:11">Kub 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 12:1">2 Bus 12:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 12:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima aba Yuda baakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, baamwitsa eihari ahabw'ebibi ebi baabaire nibakora, byakira ebibi byona ebi baishenkurubo baakozire. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:2">Bir 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:4">2 Bag 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:5">Isa 57:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:20">Yer 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba bakeeyombekyera amaju omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, n'enyomyo, na Asherimu, ahari buri kibungo kiraingwa, n'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi; <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Bir 23:17</ref>. </char></note> kandi omu nsi egyo hakaba harimu ebitingwa. Abantu bakaba nibakora ebihagaro byona eby'abanyamahanga abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:2">2 Bus 12:2</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 12:9-11">9-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kataano ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Rehoboamu, Shishaki omugabe wa Misri akainamuka, yaateera Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17">1 Bag 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:18">15:18</ref>. </char></note> yaanyaga ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'eby'omu nju y'omugabe; yaabitwara byona. Kandi yaatwara n'engabo zoona ez'ezaabu ezi Sulemaani yaabaire aheesire. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Bwanyima omugabe Rehoboamu yaaheesesa engabo omu miringa omu mwanya gwa ziri, yaazibiitsya abakuru b'abarinzi, abaabaire nibakumiirira aha rwigi rw'enju y'omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Kandi omugabe ku yaabaire ataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA, abo barinzi bakaba bazihagatira, bwanyima bazigarura omu nju y'abarinzi.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:15">2 Bus 12:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 12:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Rehoboamu n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Bag 12:21-24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi haaguma nihabaho engamba ahagati ya Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:13">2 Bus 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:7">Mat 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Rehoboamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Nyina akaba naayetwa Naama Omwamonikazi. Bwanyima omutabani Abiyamu yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Abiyamu omugabe wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 13:1-2">2 Bus 13:1-2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, Abiyamu akatandika kutegyeka Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Yaategyekyera emyaka eshatu omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Maaka, muhara wa Abishalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">1 Bag 8:61</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:4">11:4</ref>. </char></note> Abiyamu ogwo yaaguma naagyendera omu bibi byona ebi ishe owaamubandiize yaakozire; ahabw'okuba omutima gwe gwona gukaba gutari gw'amazima ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga we, nk'ogwa ishenkuru. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Bag 11:36</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ahabwa Daudi, MUKAMA Ruhanga we yaamuha etabaaza omuri Yerusaalemu, yaataho omwana we owaamuhunguriire, kandi yaahamya Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:14">2 Sam 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 11:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:9">12:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:4">1 Bag 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:8">14:8</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba Daudi akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, tiyaateishuka kyona eki yaamuragiire ebiro byona eby'amagara ge, okwihaho ebya Uriya Omuhiiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kandi haaguma nihabaho obweme ahagati ya Rehoboamu na Yeroboamu ebiro byona eby'amagara ge. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:2-20">2 Bus 13:2-20</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 13:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Endiijo mirimo ya Abiyamu n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? Kandi haaguma nihabaho obweme ahagati ya Abiyamu na Yeroboamu. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:1">2 Bus 14:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abiyamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika omu rurembo rwa Daudi. Omutabani Asa yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyabaireho omu busingye bwa Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri gw'omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu omugabe wa Israeli, Asa akatandika kutegyeka Yuda; <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />yaategyekyera emyaka makumi ana na gumwe omuri Yerusaalemu. Kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Maaka, muhara wa Abishalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:2">2 Bus 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Asa ogwo akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA nk'oku Daudi ishenkuru yaakozire. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:24">1 Bag 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:8">2 Bus 15:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaabinga ebitingwa omu nsi, kandi yaihaho ebishushani byona ebi baishenkuru baakozire. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:16-18">2 Bus 15:16-18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaabinga na nyima Maaka, yaamwiha aha bwanyin'omugabe, naamutura ekishushani ky'ekihagaro eki yaakoreire Ashera; ekyo kishushani Asa yaakitema, yaakyokyeza aha kagyera Kidirooni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:20">Kur 32:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:43">1 Bag 22:43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:3">2 Bag 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:4">14:4</ref>. </char></note> N'ekya buzima emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu teraihirweho. Kwonka omutima gwa Asa gwaguma guri ogw'amazima ahari MUKAMA ebiro bye byona. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:51">1 Bag 7:51</ref>. </char></note> Yaareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA ebintu ebi ishe yaashoroire, n'ebindi ebi yaashoroire ahabwe, efeeza, ezaabu n'ebintu by'okukoresa.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Kandi haaguma nihabaho obweme ahagati ya Asa na Baasha omugabe wa Israeli ebiro byabo byona. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:1-6">2 Bus 16:1-6</ref>. </char></note> Baasha ogwo omugabe wa Israeli yainamuka, yaateera Yuda, yaayombeka Raama, ngu azibire omuntu weena okuruga omu bugabe bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, nari okubwijamu. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:24">1 Bag 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:26">14:26</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:18">2 Bag 12:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Asa yaatwara efeeza n'ezaabu zoona, ezaabaire zitsigaire omu bintu by'obuguzi bwingi ebibiikirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'ebindi ebibiikirwe omu nju y'omugabe, yaabiha abagaragwa be; yaabatuma ahari Benihadadi mwene Taburimooni, mwijukuru wa Hezioni, omugabe wa Siria, owaabaire atwire Damasiko, naagira ati: <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:7">2 Bus 16:7</ref>. </char></note> Ka tukore endagaano y'okukwatanisa nyowe naiwe, nk'oku tata na sho baabaire bagiine. Kandi reeba naakutwekyera ekiconco ky'efeeza n'ezaabu; irooko oite endagaano yaawe na Baasha omugabe wa Israeli, abone kundugaho. <verse eid="1KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Benihadadi yaikiriza eki omugabe Asa yaamushaba, yaayohereza abakuru b'amahe ge kuteera endembo za Israeli, yaakubuura Iyooni, Daani, Abeeli-besimaaka, na Kineroosi yoona hamwe n'ensi yoona eya Nafutaali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Baasha ku yaakihuriire, yaarekyera aho kwombeka Raama, yaaguma Tiruza. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Bwanyima omugabe Asa yaarangirira omu Bayuda boona, tiyaagira u yaatsiga, baaza Raama, baihayo amabaare n'ebiti ebi Baasha yaabaire ayombekyeise; omugabe Asa yaabyombekyesa Geeba ya Benyamiini na Mizipa. <verse eid="1KI 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23, 24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:11-14">2 Bus 15:11-14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo yoona eya Asa, amaani ge goona, ebi yaakozire byona, n'endembo ezi yaayombekire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu bunsigye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? Kwonka omu bugurusi bwe ebigyere bye bikarwara. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:1">2 Bus 17:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Asa yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi ishenkuru; Yehoshafaati omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Nadabu na Baasha, abagabe ba Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:20">1 Bag 14:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Nadabu mwene Yeroboamu akatandika kutegyeka Israeli; yaategyekyera Israeli emyaka ebiri. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:30">1 Bag 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:16">14:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, yaagyendera omu muhanda gwa ishe, n'omu kibi kye eki yaasiisiise Abaisraeli.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:14">1 Bag 14:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Baasha mwene Ahiya ow'omu ruganda rwa Isakaari yaamugiira omu naama, yaamwitira Gibesooni, ey'Abafilistia; ahakuba Nadabu na Israeli yoona bakaba bagotsire Gibesooni. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda nibwo yaamwita, akategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Bag 14:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 14:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize ati kuza aha ngoma, yaita ab'enju ya Yeroboamu muntu weena orikwitsya, okuhitsya obu yaagicwekyereize, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaarabize omu mwiru we Ahiya owa Shiilo oku kyabaire kiri, <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />ahabw'ebibi ebi Yeroboamu yaakozire, n'ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli, n'ahabw'okwitsa ekiniga MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Nadabu n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Kandi haaguma nihabaho obweme ahagati ya Asa na Baasha omugabe wa Israeli ebiro byabo byona.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Baasha mwene Ahiya akatandika kutegyeka Israeli yoona ari Tiruza, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka makumi abiri n'ena. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Yaakora ebirikwanga MUKAMA, naagyendera omu muhanda gwa Yeroboamu, n'omu kibi kye eki yaasiisiise Abaisraeli.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ebyabaireho omu busingye bwa Baasha, Ela, Zimuri na Omuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yehu mwene Hanani kuhana Baasha, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:7">1 Bag 14:7</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:34">15:34</ref>. </char></note> Nkakwiha omu mucuucu, naakukuza, naakugira omwebembezi w'eihanga ryangye Israeli; mbwenu ogyendeire omu muhanda gwa Yeroboamu, waasiisisa abantu bangye Abaisraeli, baanyitsa ekiniga n'ebibi byabo. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Bag 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:29">15:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:21">21:21</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo niinyija kukwihiraho kimwe n'enju yaawe, ngigire nk'eya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:11">1 Bag 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:24">21:24</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu wa Baasha weena, origwa omu rurembo, aryariibwa embwa; kandi origwa omu ishwa, aryariibwa amahungu.<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Mbwenu endiijo emirimo ya Baasha yoona, n'ebi yaakozire n'eby'amaani ge, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Bwanyima Baasha yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa Tiruza; Ela omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="1KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:27-29">1 Bag 15:27-29</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:4">Hos 1:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaraba omuri Yehu mwene Hanani nikihana Baasha n'enju ye, ahabw'obubi bwona obu yaakozire omu maisho ga MUKAMA, naamwitsa ekiniga n'ebi yaakozire n'emikono ye nk'eby'enju ya Yeroboamu, kandi n'ahabw'okucwekyereza egyo nju.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri na mukaaga ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Ela mwene Baasha akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Tiruza, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka ebiri. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:31">2 Bag 9:31</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima omugaragwa we Zimuri, omukuru w'ekicweka kimwe ky'ebigaari bye, yaamugiira omu naama kumurwanisa. Ela ku yaabaire ari Tiruza omu nju ya Aruza omukuru w'ekikaari kye omuri Tiruza, naanywa okuhitsya obu araasinde, <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Zimuri yaatahamu, yaamuteera, yaamugwisaho, omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Ku yaatandikire kutegyeka, aherize ati kuza aha ngoma, yaita ab'enju ya Baasha boona; tiyaamutsigira oyetwa omwojo omuri beene waabo nari omuri banywani be. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Okwo nikwo Zimuri yaacwekyereize ab'enju ya Baasha boona, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaarabize omuri nabi Yehu naahana Baasha, oku kyabaire kiri, <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:31">Bir 32:31</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'ebibi bya Baasha byona, n'eby'omutabani Ela ebi baakozire, kandi ebi baasiisiise Abaisraeli, bakaitsa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli ekiniga n'eby'obufamutima byabo. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Ela yoona n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Zimuri akategyekyera ebiro mushanju omuri Tiruza. Obwo engabo zikaba ziteire orusiisira kurwanisa Gibesooni ey'Abafilistia; <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />bwanyima engabo ezaabaire ziri omuri orwo rusiisira zikahurira nibagira bati: Zimuri agiire omu naama, yaita omugabe; nikyo Abaisraeli boona bahinduriire Omuri omukuru w'eihe omugabe wa Israeli aha izooba eryo bakiri omu rusiisira. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Atyo Omuri yainamuka kuruga Gibesooni n'Abaisraeli boona, baagota Tiruza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimuri ku yaareebire orurembo rwanyagwa, yaataaha omu kigo ky'omu kikaari ky'omugabe, yaayeyokyeza omu nju y'omugabe, yaafa, <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">1 Bag 15:26</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:34">34</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'ebibi ebi yaakozire, naakora kubi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, naagyendera omu muhanda gwa Yeroboamu, n'ahabw'ekibi eki yaasiisiise Abaisraeli <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Zimuri yoona n'obugomi obu yaagomire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Bwanyima Abaisraeli baayecwamu habiri, ekicweka kimwe kyakuratira Tibuni mwene Ginaasi kumuhindura omugabe, n'ekindi kyakuratira Omuri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Kwonka abantu abaakuratiire Omuri baasingura abaakuratiire Tibuni mwene Ginaasi; atyo Tibuni yaafa, Omuri yaaba omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Omuri akatandika kutegyeka Israeli, yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi n'ebiri; omuri egyo yaamara emyaka mukaaga naategyekyera Tiruza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Bwanyima yaagura ahari Shemeri ekibungo ekirikwetwa Samaria etalanta ibiri z'efeeza, yaakyombekaho orurembo, n'orurembo orwo yaarweta Samaria, naarweterera Shemeri mukama w'ekyo kibungo.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mik 6:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, kandi yaakora kubi okukira boona abaamubandiize; <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">1 Bag 15:26</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 15:34">34</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba akagyendera omu muhanda gwona ogwa Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, n'omu bibi ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli, bakaitsa MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ekiniga ahabw'eby'obufamutima byabo. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ei Omuri yaakozire yoona, n'eby'amaani agu yaayorekire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Bwanyima Omuri yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omuri Samaria; Ahabu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na munaana gw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Ahabu mwene Omuri akatandika kutegyeka Israeli; yaategyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria emyaka makumi abiri n'ebiri. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Omu busingye bwe yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA okukira boona abaamubandiize. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Kur 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3">Bir 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:25">1 Bag 21:25</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tiyaakyeta kintu kibi okugyendera omu muhanda gwa Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, yaagaruka yaashwera Yezebeeli muhara wa Isi-baali, omugabe w'Abasidoni, yaagyenda yaaheereza Baali, kandi yaaguma naamuramya. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:21">2 Bag 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 10:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 10:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Yaayombekyera Baali ogwo eitambiro omu nju ei yaabaire amwombekyeire Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:15">1 Bag 14:15</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:19">18:19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:10">2 Bag 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:3">21:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 14:3">2 Bus 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:2">Yer 17:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ahabu yaakora Ashera. Yaakira abagabe ba Israeli boona abaamubandiize okwitsa MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, ekiniga. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Yos 6:26</ref>. </char></note> Omu busingye bwe Hieli owa Beseeli akombeka Yeriko; ku yaayombekire ati omusingi gwarwo, omwana we w'omujigaijo Abiramu yaafa; kandi ku yaatairemu ati ebiti by'eirembo ryarwo, omwana we wa bucuranda Seguba nawe yaafa, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaarabize omuri Yoshua mwene Nuuni, oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya okuranga enjara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:1">1 Bag 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:25">Luk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:17">Yak 5:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Eliya owa Tishubi, omwe aha bashuhuuki ba Gileadi, yaagira Ahabu ati: Nindahira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, ou mpeereza, tiharibaho rume nari enjura omuri egi myaka okuhitsya obu ndibiragiira. <verse eid="1KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyamwizira nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />Ruga aha, otoore oburugwa-izooba, oyesherekye aha rubaju rw'akagyera akarikwetwa Kerisi, aharikureebana na Yorudani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Noija kuguma noonywa amaizi ahari ako kagyera, kandi naaragiira ebikoona kuguma nibikugyemurirayo. <verse eid="1KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Atyo yaagyenda, yaatwaza nk'oku MUKAMA yaamugambira; yaaza ahari ako kagyera Kerisi, akateegaine na Yorudani, yaagumayo. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Ebikoona byaguma nibimureetera emigaati n'enyama buri kasheeshe n'omu mwabazyo; kandi yaaguma naanywa amaizi ahari ako kagyera. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro, ako kagyera kaayoma, ahabw'okuba enjura ekaba etarikugwa muri egyo nsi.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya okuraara omw'omufaakazi owa Zarefaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyamwizira nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />Imuka oze Zarefaasi ey'Abasidoni, obe niyo waaguma. Reeba, niyo ndagiire omufaakazi kuguma naakugaburira. <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Atyo yaimuka, yaaza Zarefaasi; ku yaahikire aha irembo ry'orurembo, yaashanga omukazi omufaakazi naatorotoora otuku; yaamweta, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndeetera otwizi omu nkyeka, ntunywe. <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Ku yaabaire naaza kugyenda, Eliya yaamweta, yaamugira ati: Ondeetere n'akagaati omu ngaro. <verse eid="1KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Onu yaamugira ati: Ninkurahira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, tiinyine kagaati, kureka oruhi rw'esaano omu kanyungu n'amajuta makye omu katsimbo; mbwenu nintorotoora obuyaayo bubiri, mbone kugaruka omuka, nkeeteekyere na mutabani wangye, tukarye, tufe. <verse eid="1KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya yaamugira ati: Otatiina; irooko otwaze nk'oku waagamba; kwonka banza onteekyereho kakye, okandeetere, bwanyima obone kweteekyera n'omwana waawe; <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Esaano y'omuri ako kanyungu terikwija kuhwaho, n'amajuta ag'omuri ako katsimbo tigarikwija kuhwamu, okuhitsya aha izooba eri MUKAMA arigwisizaho enjura ahansi. <verse eid="1KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Ogwo mukazi yaagyenda, yaatwaza nk'oku Eliya yaamugira; bwanyima we na Eliya n'ab'omu ka ye baamara ebiro bingi nibarya; <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />esaano y'omuri ako kanyungu tiyaahwaho, n'amajuta g'omuri ako katsimbo tigaahwamu, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki yaarabize omuri Eliya, oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya okuhimbuura omwana w'omufaakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Bwanyima y'ebyo, omwana w'ogwo mukazi nyineeka yaarwara; endwara yaamurembya, okuhitsya obu omwitsyo gwamuhweereiremu kimwe. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:34">Luk 4:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:8">5:8</ref>. </char></note> Nyina yaagira Eliya ati: Iwe muntu wa Ruhanga 'we, noofa ki naanye? Okaija omwangye kunyijutsya ekibi kyangye, n'okuunyitira omwana! <verse eid="1KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya yaamugira ati: Mpa omwana waawe. Atyo yaamumwiha omu kifuba, yaamwinamura omu kishengye kya kaanyinaibiri eki yaabaire naaraaramu, yaamurambika aha kitanda kye. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Yaatakira MUKAMA ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, niiwe oreetsire akabi n'aha mufaakazi ogu orikundaaza, ak'okwita omwana we? <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:34">2 Bag 4:34</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 4:35">35</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:10">Byak 20:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaayegororera ahari ogwo mwana kashatu, naatakira MUKAMA ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye, ninkweshengyereza, ikiriza amagara g'ogu mwana gamugarukyemu. <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:35">Heb 11:35</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaahurira okushaba kwa Eliya, amagara g'ogwo mwana gaamugarukamu, yaahimbuuka. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya yaatwara ogwo mwana, yaamwiha omu kishengye kya kaanyinaibiri, yaamushuumya, yaamutaasya omu nju, yaamuha nyina; yaamugira ati: Reeba, omwana waawe ahuriire. <verse eid="1KI 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:2">Yoh 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo mukazi yaagira Eliya ati: Mbwenu naamanya ku ori omushaija wa Ruhanga, kandi n'ekigambo kya Ruhanga eki orikugamba ku kiri eky'amazima.<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya okutuma Obadia ahari Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro bingi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaizira Eliya omu mwaka gwa kashatu, nikigira kiti: Irooko, oyeyorekye Ahabu; naanye niinyija kugwisa enjura aha nsi. <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Atyo Eliya yaaza kweyoreka Ahabu. Obwo enjura ekaba eri nyingi omuri Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Ahabu yaayeta Obadia owaabaire ari omukuru w'eka ye. (Obadia ogwo akaba naatiina munonga MUKAMA; <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />kandi obu Yezebeeli yaita baanabi ba MUKAMA, Obadia akatwara baanabi igana, yaashereka makumi ataano-ataano omu nyanga, yaaguma naabaheeramu eby'okurya n'amaizi.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ahabu yaagira Obadia ati: Irooko ogyendagyende omu nsi aha nshuro zoona ez'amaizi n'omu mpanga zoona; obundi tukaareeba obunyaatsi, tutambira embaraasi n'enyumbu, amatungo goona gareka kufa. <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Batyo baagaba ensi ebirari, ngu babone kugirabamu yoona; Ahabu yaagyenda okwe, na Obadia okwe.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadia ku yaabaire naakigyenda, yaabugaabugana na Eliya; Obadia yaamumanya, yaajuumara ahansi, yaagira ati: Niiwe, Mukama wangye Eliya? <verse eid="1KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Niinye. Gyenda ogambire mukama waawe oti: Reeba, Eliya ari aha. <verse eid="1KI 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ncumwire ki okuhayo omwiru waawe ahari Ahabu, ngu anyite? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Ninkurahira MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, tihariho ihanga n'obu bwakuba obugabe, ei mukama wangye atatumire bantu b'okukusherura; kandi ku baakugizire ngu tari kunu, akaarahiize obwo bugabe nari eryo ihanga, ku batakureebire. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Mbwenu noogira oti: Gyenda ogambire mukama waawe, oti: Reeba, Eliya ari aha. <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Kandi ku ndaabe naakurugaho nti, Omwoyo wa MUKAMA naija kukutwara ei ntarikumanya; ku ndaagyende naagambira Ahabu, yaija, ataakureeba, naija kuunyita, n'obu ndaabe nyowe omwiru waawe ntiina Ruhanga okwiha omu buto bwangye. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Mukama wangye, tokahuriraga eki naakozire, obu Yezebeeli yaita baanabi ba MUKAMA, ku naasherekire abashaija igana, baanabi ba MUKAMA, makumi ataano-ataano omu nyanga, kandi nkaguma nimbaheeramu eby'okurya n'amaizi? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Mbwenu noogira oti: Irooko ogambire mukama waawe, oti: Reeba, Eliya ari aha; ekiraarugyemu naija kuunyita. <verse eid="1KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya yaamugira ati: Ninkurahira MUKAMA ow'amahe, ou mpeereza, buzimazima nimmweyoreka eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Atyo Obadia yaagyenda kubugana Ahabu, na Ahabu yaaza kubugana Eliya.<verse eid="1KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya okureebana na Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 21:20">1 Bag 21:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabu ku yaareebire Eliya, yaamugira ati: Niiwe, iwe orikunyangaraza Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:9">1 Bag 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:31">16:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">24:20</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Nyowe tinkanyangaraize Israeli, kureka niiwe n'enju ya sho, ahabw'okuba mukareka ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, mwakuratira baabali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:33">1 Bag 16:33</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu nu ntumira Abaisraeli boona, bateeranire aha kibungo Karumeeli na baanabi ba Baali magana ana na makumi ataano, kandi n'abandi magana ana ba Ashera, abariira aha meeza ya Yezebeeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Atyo Ahabu yaatuma aha Baisraeli boona, kandi yaateeranira baanabi abo aha kibungo Karumeeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:15">Yos 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:41">2 Bag 17:41</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref>. </char></note> Abo boona ku baahikireyo, Eliya yaabairira haihi, yaabagira ati: Muryahitsya hi n'okugira emitima ebiri? MUKAMA ku araabe ari Ruhanga, mumukuratire; nari Baali ku araabe ari Ruhanga, mube niwe mwakuratira. Abantu tibaagira ki baamugarukamu. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Bag 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Eliya yaagaruka yaagira abantu ati: Nyowe, nyowe nyenka niinye nabi wa MUKAMA otsigaireho; kwonka baanabi ba Baali n'abashaija magana ana na makumi ataano. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Mbwenu ka batuhe enimi ibiri, bo baiheho emwe ahabwabo, bagitematememu ebicweka, babite aha nku, kwonka batatamu omuriro; naanye niinyija kubaaga eya kabiri, ngite aha nku, ndekye kutamu omuriro. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:38">1 Bag 18:38</ref>. </char></note> Imwe mwete eiziina rya ruhanga waanyu, naanye niinyija kweta eiziina rya MUKAMA; kandi Ruhanga oraagarukisemu omuriro, biri ogwo niwe Ruhanga. Abantu boona baagarukamu bati: Eki waagamba nikwo. <verse eid="1KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Bwanyima Eliya yaagira baanabi ba Baali ati: Mwetooranireho enimi emwe, mube niimwe mwabanza kubaaga, ahabw'okuba muri baingi; haza mwete eiziina rya ruhanga waanyu, kwonka mutatamu omuriro. <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Batyo baatwara enimi ei baaheebwa, baagibaaga, baayeta eiziina rya Baali okwiha omu kasheeshe okuhitsya omu ihangwe, nibagira bati: Ai Baali, otuhurire! Kwonka tihaabaho iraka, nari owaabagarukamu. Baaguma nibagurukagurukira aha itambiro eri baayombeka. <verse eid="1KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Omu ihangwe Eliya yaabateerera enaku naagira ati: Nimwete munonga; ahabw'okuba ni ruhanga; nooshusha oti naateekateeka, nari aine ah'ari, nari azindukire, nari shi agwejegyeire, ashemereire kusisiimurwa. <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lev 19:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:1">Bir 14:1</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baayeta nibaamuza, baayeshara na zaarurara n'emisyo nk'oku baabaire bagira, okuhitsya obu eshagama yaajwire n'amaani. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39">Kur 29:39</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 29:41">41</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'eihangwe baagumizamu nibaamuza okuhitsya obunaku bw'okutamba ekitambo ky'omu mwabazyo; kwonka tihaabaho iraka, nari ow'okubagarukamu, n'obu yaakuba ow'okubeetaho.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Bag 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Eliya yaagira abantu boona ati: Nimumpikye haihi. Abantu boona baamuhika haihi. Yaagaruka yaayombeka eitambiro rya MUKAMA, eryabaire risheenyirwe; <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35:10</ref>. </char></note> yaihaho amabaare ikumi n'abiri, agarikwingana n'omubaro gw'enganda za batabani ba Yakobo, ou ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaiziire nikigira kiti: Israeli niryo riraabe eiziina ryawe; <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />ago mabaare yaagombekyesa eitambiro omu iziina rya MUKAMA. Yaateera oruhazo okwehinguririza eitambiro orurikuhikwamu encuro ibiri z'embibo. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 1:7">Lev 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:20">Bar 6:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaateekyeraho enku, yaatematema enimi, yaagita aha nku, yaagira ati: Mwijuze enyungu z'amaizi ina, mugashukye aha kitambo ky'okwotsya n'aha nku. <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mukore mutyo obwa kabiri; baakikora obwa kabiri; yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mukore mutyo obwa kashatu; baakikora obwa kashatu; <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />amaizi gaahimintika, gaayehinguririza eitambiro, gaijuza n'oruhazo.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kur 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:28">Kub 16:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 4:24">Yos 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:46">1 Sam 17:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu bunaku bw'okutamba ekitambo ky'omu mwabazyo, Eliya nabi yairira haihi, yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka, kandi owa Israeli, ka kimanywe eri izooba ku niiwe Ruhanga omuri Israeli, naanye ku ndi omuheereza waawe, kandi ku nkozire ebi byona ahabw'ekigambo kyawe. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Ngarukamu, ai MUKAMA; ngarukamu, abantu aba bamanye ku niiwe, ai MUKAMA, ori Ruhanga, kandi ku niiwe ohindwire emitima yaabo, ekakugarukira. <verse eid="1KI 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:24">1 Bag 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 9:24">Lev 9:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho omuriro gwa MUKAMA gwagwa aha kitambo ky'okwotsya, gwakyokyeza kimwe hamwe n'enku n'amabaare n'omucuucu, gwakomba n'amaizi g'omu ruhazo. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Abantu boona ku baakireebire, baajuumara ahansi, baagira bati: MUKAMA niwe Ruhanga! MUKAMA niwe Ruhanga!<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya okwita baanabi ba Baali, n'okuhanguka kw'enjura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 10:25">2 Bag 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:17">Bar 4:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eliya yaabagira ati: Mukwate baanabi ba Baali; hatagira n'omwe owagyenda. Baabakwata; Eliya yaabashuumya aha kagyera Kishoni, yaabaitiraho. <verse eid="1KI 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Bwanyima yaagira Ahabu ati: Imuka, orye, onywe; ahakuba hariho okuhoorera kw'enjura nyingi munonga. <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:17">Yak 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Ahabu yainamuka kurya n'okunywa. Na Eliya yainamuka aha mutwe gw'ekibungo Karumeeli; yaajuumara, omutwe yaaguta omu maguru. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Yaagira omuheereza we ati: Inamuka, onagye amaisho aha nyanja. Yainamuka, yaareebayo, yaagira ati: Tihaine kiriyo. Onu ati: Garukayo emirundi mushanju. <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:54">Luk 12:54</ref>. </char></note> Aha murundi gwa mushanju omuheereza yaagira ati: Reeba ekicu ekirikushusha ekiganja ky'omuntu nikiimuka omu nyanja. Eliya yaamugira ati: Irooko ogire Ahabu oti: Tebeekanisa ekigaari kyawe, oshuume, enjura etakaakutangira aho. <verse eid="1KI 18:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Omu kaanya kakye eiguru ryairirimba ahabw'ebicu n'omuyaga, haagwa enjura nyingi. Ahabu yaatemba ekigaari, yaaza Yezereeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:15">2 Bag 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:14">3:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omukono gwa MUKAMA gwaza ahari Eliya, yaayezirika, yairukanga omu maisho ga Ahabu, yaahika aha irembo rya Yezereeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okweyorekyera Eliya aha rushozi Horebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabu yaateekyerereza Yezebeeli byona ebi Eliya yaakora, n'oku yaita baanabi boona na rurara. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:10">1 Bag 20:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yezebeeli yaatuma ahari Eliya naagira ati: Nyencakare nk'aga magingo ku ndaabe ntagizire magara gaawe nk'oku waagira agaabo, baaruhanga bakinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya nikwo kutiina, akaimuka, akahunzya amagara, akahika Beeri-sheba eya Yuda, akatsigayo omuheereza we.<verse eid="1KI 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:15">Kub 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="JON 4:3">Yon 4:3</ref>, <ref loc="JON 4:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> We akagyenda orugyendo rw'eizooba ryona, akaza omu ihamba. Ku yaahikireyo, yaashutama ahansi y'omukinga, yaashaba Ruhanga ngu afe, naagira ati: Mperere hi! Mbwenu, ai MUKAMA, nyita; ahakuba tiinyine ki ndikuhitsa baatatenkuru. <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Yaabyama ahansi y'omukinga, yaagwejegyera; bwanyima maraika yaija, yaamukoraho, yaamugira ati: Imuka orye. <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Onu ku yaamagamagire, yaareeba aha mutwe gwe omugaati oguteekirwe aha mabaare garikwotsya, n'orunywero rw'amaizi. Yaarya, yaanywa, yaagaruka yaabyama. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaija obwa kabiri, yaamukoraho, yaagira ati: Imuka orye, orugyendo ni ruhango, rutakaakurema. <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">Kur 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34:28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:9">Bir 9:9</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 9:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:2">Mat 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaimuka, yaarya, yaanywa, yaagyendera aha mwiguto gw'ebyo by'okurya ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro, yaahika ahari Horebu orushozi rwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="1KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Ku yaahikire okwo, yaataaha omu nyanga, yaaraaramu; kandi reeba, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyamwizira; yaamugira ati: Eliya, nookora ki aha? <verse eid="1KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:11">Kub 25:11</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 25:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:22">1 Bag 18:22</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 18:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:3">Rom 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaagira ati: Ngizire eihari ringi ahabwa MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe; ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli baitsire endagaano yaawe, baasheenya amatambiro gaawe, baita baanabi baawe na rurara; nyowe, nyowe nyenka, niinye ntsigaireho; kandi naanye nibenda kuunyita. <verse eid="1KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:2">Kur 24:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:2">34:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:4">Ezk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:7">37:7</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Shohora, oyemerere ahari oru rushozi omu maisho ga MUKAMA. MUKAMA yaarabaho, omuyaga mwingi gw'amaani gwashatura enshozi, gwayatagura enkiri omu maisho ga MUKAMA; kwonka MUKAMA akaba atagurimu. Bwanyima y'omuyaga haija omutsitsa, kwonka MUKAMA akaba atagurimu; <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />bwanyima y'omutsitsa haija omuriro, kwonka MUKAMA akaba atagurimu; bwanyima y'omuriro haija akaraka kakye kandi koorobi. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kur 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Eliya ku yaakahuriire, yaayeshweka omunagiro aha maisho, yaashohora, yaayemerera aha munwa gw'enyanga. Haija eiraka, ryamugira riti: Eliya nookora ki aha? <verse eid="1KI 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Yaagarukamu ati: Ngizire eihari ringi ahabwa MUKAMA, Ruhanga ow'amahe; ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli baitsire endagaano yaawe, baasheenya amatambiro gaawe, na baanabi baawe baabaitsa rurara; nyowe, nyowe nyeka, niinye ntsigaireho; kandi naanye nibansherura kuunyita. <verse eid="1KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Irooko ogarukyeyo, otoore omuhanda gurikuza omu ihamba rya Damasiko; ku oraahikyeyo, oshukye amajuta ahari Hazaeli kuba omugabe wa Siria; <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:9">2 Bag 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 2:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:1-6">9:1-6</ref>. </char></note> kandi na Yehu mwene Nimushi omushukyeho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli, na Elisa mwene Shafati owa Abeeli-mehoola, omushukyeho amajuta kuba nabi omu mwanya gwawe. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:20">9:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:3">13:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:5">Hos 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Oriba yaakizire rurara ya Hazaeli, aryaitwa Yehu; kandi oriba yaakizire rurara ya Yehu, aryaitwa Elisa. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:2">Hos 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:4">Rom 11:4</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ndyayetsigiraho abantu enkumi mushanju omuri Israeli, abatakatsimbiraga Baali maju, n'obu kwakuba okumunywegyera.<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa okuhinduka omuheereza wa Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:8">2 Bag 2:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo yaarugayo, yaashanga Elisa mwene Shafati naahingisa ente makumi abiri na ina ezikomeraine ibiri-ibiri omu mishorongo ebiri, zimuri omu maisho, kwonka we aine ibiri ezirikuhereerukayo; Eliya yaakiikama; ku yaabaire naamurabaho, yaamunagaho omunagiro gwe. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:61">Luk 9:61</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:62">62</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaatsigaho ente, yaamwirukaho, yaamugira ati: Reka mbanze nnywegyere tata na maawe, mbone kukukuratira. Yaamugarukamu ati: Garukayo; mbwenu waareeba naakugira nta? <verse eid="1KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:22">2 Sam 24:22</ref>. </char></note> Tiyaamukuratira, yaagarukayo, yaatwara ente ibiri, yaaziita, yaaziteekyesa ebiti ebyaba bizikomire, yaagaburira abantu, baarya. Bwanyima yaimuka, yaakurata Eliya, yaaguma naamuhereza.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Benihadadi, omugabe wa Siria, okurahura Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:18">1 Bag 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:31">22:31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 6:24">2 Bag 6:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:7">8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Benihadadi, omugabe wa Siria, yaateerana hamwe eihe rye ryona, yaakwatanisa n'abandi bagabe makumi ashatu na babiri, abaabaire baine embaraasi n'ebigaari; yainamuka, yaagota Samaria, yaagirwanisa. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Yaatuma entumwa omu rurembo ahari Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo Benihadadi arikugamba naagira ati: <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />Efeeza zaawe n'ezaabu zaawe n'ebyangye; abakazi baawe abarikuhita abandi boona, n'abaana baawe, nabo n'abangye. <verse eid="1KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaamugarukamu ati: Nk'oku waagira, Nyakusinga Omugabe, ndi owaawe n'ebyangye byona. <verse eid="1KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Bwanyima ezo ntumwa zaagaruka ahari Ahabu, zaamugira ziti: Oku nikwo Benihadadi arikugamba naagira ati: Nkutumireho ningira nti: Nyoherereza efeeza zaawe n'ezaabu zaawe, abakazi baawe n'abaana baawe; <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />mbwenu nyencakare nk'aga magingo niinyija kukutumaho abashaija bangye, nibacaaka enju yaawe n'amaju g'abagaragwa baawe; eki baraagweho kyona ekirikubashemeza, nibakitwara.<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 21:8">1 Bag 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aho omugabe wa Israeli yaayeta abakuru b'ensi ye, yaabagira ati: Mbwenu mwetegyereze, mureebe omushaija ogu, ku arikutaara akabi; ahabw'okuba abaire yantumireho abakazi bangye, n'abaana, n'efeeza, n'ezaabu, kandi timmwangiire. <verse eid="1KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Abakuru boona n'abantu boona baamugira bati: Otakitaho omutima, kandi otaikiriza. <verse eid="1KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Atyo yaagira entumwa za Benihadadi ati: Mugambire mukama wangye omugabe muti: Byona ebi obandize kutuma aha mwiru waawe, niinyija kubikora; kwonka eki tindikwija kukikora. Entumwa zaagyenda, zaamugambira ebi Ahabu yaazituma. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:2">1 Bag 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Benihadadi yaamutumaho naamugira ati: Engabo zangye zoona ezirikunkuratira ku ziraahikwe omucuucu gwa Samaria, buri muntu yaabona ogurikwijuza oruhi, baaruhanga bakinture n'okukiraho. <verse eid="1KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagarukamu ati: Orikujwara eby'okurwanisa naaza aha rugamba, arekye kwehimbisa nk'orikubijuura yaatabaarukire. <verse eid="1KI 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Obwo Benihadadi akaba ari omu rusiisira naanywa n'abandi bagabe; ku yaahuriire obwo butumwa, yaagira engabo ze ati: Mutengye orugamba. Batyo baatenga orugamba kurwanisa orurembo.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nabi okugambira Ahabu ku arikwija kusingura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:36">1 Bag 18:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho nabi yairira haihi Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Waareeba engabo ziriya zoona oku ziri nyingi? Eri izooba niinyija kuzihayo omu mikono yaawe, omanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ahabu yaamubuuza ati: Ou araakorese n'oha? Onu ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: N'abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza. Yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: oraatandikye orwo rugamba n'oha? Yaamugarukamu ati: Niiwe. <verse eid="1KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Atyo yaateerana abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza; baaba magana abiri na makumi ashatu na babiri; bwanyima yaabo yaateerana Abaisraeli boona, baaba enkumi mushanju.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Baahurura omu ihangwe, Benihadadi ari omu rusiisira naayenywera asinzire, we n'abo bagabe makumi ashatu na babiri abaabaire baizire kumuha emikono. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Abashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza baaba nibo baabanza kuhurura. Bwanyima Benihadadi yaatuma entatsi, zaamugira ziti: Twareeba abashaija nibaruga omuri Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Yaagira ati: Ku baraabe bareetwa obusingye, mubakwate bahuriire; kandi ku baraabe bareetwa okurwana, nabwo mubakwate bahuriire.<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Batyo abo bashaija b'abategyeki b'amashaza baaruga omu rurembo n'eihe ribakuratiire. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Buri muntu yaayeitira omuntu we; Abasiria baahunga, Abaisraeli baababinga, kwonka Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria yaahungira aha mbaraasi n'abatembire embaraasi, yaakira. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Omugabe wa Israeli nawe yaahurura, yaakwata embaraasi n'ebigaari, yaita Abasiria baingi munonga. <verse eid="1KI 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Bwanyima nabi ogwo yairira haihi omugabe wa Israeli, yaamugira ati: Irooko oyehamye, oteekateekye oku oshemereire kutwaza; ahabw'okuba omu kutandika kw'omwaka omugabe wa Siria aryagaruka kukurwanisa.<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahabu okugaruka kusingura Benihadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Bwanyima abagaragwa b'omugabe wa Siria baamugira bati: Manya baaruhanga baabo ni baaruhanga b'ebibungo; nikyo baatukiriize amaani; mbwenu murekye turwanire nabo omu mpita, buzima nitwija kubakiza emikono. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Hati twaza oti; ihaho abo bagabe, buri omwe omwihe omu mwanya gwe, omu myanya yaabo otemu abakuru b'engabo; <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />kandi oteerane eihe eririkwingana n'eihe eri ofeereirwe, ogarure embaraasi omu mwanya gw'embaraasi, n'ekigaari omu mwanya gw'ekigaari; haza turwanire nabo omu mpita; buzima nitwija kubakiza emikono. Yaahurira ebi barikugamba, yaatwaza atyo.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Omwaka ku gwabaire nigutandika, Benihadadi yaateerana hamwe Abasiria, yainamuka Afeki kurwanisa Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />N'Abaisraeli baateeranirwa hamwe, baaheebwa entanda, baaza kubarwanisa. Abaisraeli baateera orusiisira omu maisho gaabo nibashusha nk'obusyo bukye bubiri bw'embuzi, kwonka Abasiria bo baashweka ensi. <verse eid="1KI 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Omushaija wa Ruhanga yairira haihi, yaagambira omugabe wa Israeli, ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'Abasiria okugira ngu, MUKAMA ni Ruhanga w'ebibungo, ti ruhanga w'empita, nikyo ndaaheereyo engabo ziriya enyingi munonga omu mikono yaanyu; nibwo muraamanye ku ndi MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Baamara ebiro mushanju bari omu nsiisira ezirikureebana. Bwanyima aha izooba rya mushanju orugamba rwatandika; Abaisraeli baita omu ngabo z'Abasiria abantu akasiriira kamwe omu izooba rimwe. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Abandi baahungira omu rurembo rwa Afeki; orugo rwarwo rw'amabaare rwagwera ababaire baahonokaho obukumi bubiri n'enkumi mushanju. Benihadadi nawe yaahunga, yaataaha omu rurembo, yaaza omu kishengye ky'omunda. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Abagaragwa be baamugira bati: Reeba, tuhuriire ngu abagabe b'enju ya Israeli n'abagabe b'embabazi. Nitukweshengyereza, twikirize twezirikye ebiguniya, twekome emigoye omu mitwe, tushohore, tuze aha mugabe wa Israeli; obundi akaakiza amagara gaawe, oreka kufa. <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Batyo baayezirika ebiguniya omunda, baayekoma emigoye omu mitwe, baaza aha mugabe wa Israeli, baagira bati: Omwiru waawe Benihadadi naagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndeka, ngumeho. Onu yaagira ati: Biri akiriho? Ni mwene tata. <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Obwo abo bashaija bakaba bamutaireho eriisho, ngu bamanye ekiri omu biteekateeko bye; ku baakihuriire bati, baakiijaho, bati: Eego, Benihadadi ni mwene sho. Ahabu yaagira ati: Mugyende mumureete. Bwanyima Benihadadi yaashohora, yaija ah'ari, yaamutembesa omu kigaari kye. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:20">1 Bag 15:20</ref>. </char></note> Benihadadi yaamugira ati: Endembo ezi tata yaanyagire sho, niinyija kuzigarura; kandi oryayegirira amaduuka omuri Damasiko, nk'oku sho yaagagizire omuri Samaria. Ahabu yaagira ati: ku oraagire otyo, ninkurekura. Atyo yaakora nawe endagaano, yaamurekura.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okugwerwa kubi Ahabu ahabw'okurekura Benihadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:3">2 Bag 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 2:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 2:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 2:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omushaija omwe ow'omuri batabani ba baanabi yaagambira mugyenzi we ekigambo eki MUKAMA amuragiire ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nteera. Onu yaayanga kumuteera. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:24">1 Bag 13:24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okutahurira iraka rya MUKAMA, ku oraabe wandugaho oti, entare neekwita. Atyo ku yaabaire yaamurugaho, entare yaamubugana, yaamwita. <verse eid="1KI 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Yaagaruka yaareeba ondiijo mushaija, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, nteera. Ogwo mushaija yaamuteera, yaamuhutaaza. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:8">1 Sam 28:8</ref>. </char></note> Atyo nabi ogwo yaagyenda, yaategyereza omugabe aha rubaju rw'omuhanda, yaayehindura okundi ayekomire ekitambaara aha maisho. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:24">2 Bag 10:24</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe ku yaabaire naahinguraho, nabi ogwo yaamweta, yaagira ati: Nyowe omwiru waawe ngiire omu rugamba; bwanyima reeba, omushaija yaakubuuka, yandeetera omushaija, yangira ati: Rinda omushaija ogu. Ku araabure, noomuzira; nari noija kuriha etalanta emwe y'efeeza. <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Kwonka nyowe omwiru waawe ku mbaire nindabanamu ninkora oku n'oku, yaabura. Omugabe wa Israeli yaamugira ati: Orubanja rwawe nikwo ruraabe rutyo; niiwe waarwecwera. <verse eid="1KI 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Nabi ogwo yaarahuka yaiha ekitambaara aha maisho; omugabe wa Israeli yaamumanya ku ari ow'omuri baanabi. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ahabw'okurekura omushaija ou mbaire mpaireyo kwitirwa kimwe, amagara gaawe nigaija kuzira age, n'abantu baawe bazire abe. <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:4">1 Bag 21:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Israeli yaagaruka Samaria, yaataaha omu nju ye aine enaku kandi agwirwe kubi.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ahabu okunyaga omusiri gwa Nabosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija orikwetwa Nabosi owa Yezereeli, owaabaire aine omusiri gw'emizaabibu haihi n'ekikaari kya Ahabu omugabe wa Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:14">1 Sam 8:14</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Ahabu yaagira Nabosi ati: Mpa omusiri gwawe gw'emizaabibu, ngugire ogw'okuhingamu emboga, ahabw'okuba guri haihi n'eka yangye; naanye niinyija kukuha ogundi musiri gw'emizaabibu ogurikuguhita; nari shi, ku oraabe nookisiima, nkuhe empiiha ezigushemereire. <verse eid="1KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:23">Lev 25:23</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 36:7">Kub 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 46:18">Ezk 46:18</ref>. </char></note> Nabosi yaagira Ahabu ati: Nikikabure nyowe okukuha obuhunguzi bwa baatatenkuru. <verse eid="1KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:43">1 Bag 20:43</ref>. </char></note> Ahabu yaagaruka omuka aine enaku, kandi agwirwe kubi ahabw'ekigambo eki Nabosi owa Yezereeli yaamugambira; ahakuba akamugira ati: Tindikwija kukuha buhunguzi bwa baatatenkuru. Yaabyama aha kitanda kye, ahugikire omushaya, yaayanga n'okurya.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Bwanyima Yezebeeli omukazi we yaija, yaamubuuza ati: N'enki ekikugwisize kubi, kikakuzibira kurya? <verse eid="1KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ahabw'okuba naagira Nabosi owa Yezereeli nti: Mpa omusiri gwawe gw'emizaabibu, ngugure empiiha, nari shi, ku oraabe nokisiima, nkuhe ogundi omu mwanya gwagwo; nawe yangarukamu ati: Tindikwija kukuha musiri gwangye. <verse eid="1KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Omukazi we Yezebeeli yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba mihi, tiiwe orikutegyeka Israeli? Imuka orye, omutima gwawe gushemererwe. Nyowe niinyija kukuha ogwo musiri gwa Nabosi owa Yezereeli.<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 20:7">1 Bag 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:2">Rus 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Yezebeeli yaahandiika ebaruha omu iziina rya Ahabu, yaazitaho akamanyiso ka Ahabu, yaazitwekyera abakuru b'orurembo n'abakungu abaabaire batwire na Nabosi omuri orwo rurembo. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Yaahandiika omuri ezo baruha ati: Murangirire abantu boona, beesiibyekwo, mute Nabosi omu maisho g'abantu omu mwanya ogurikureebwa; <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kur 22:28</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 6:11">Byak 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:5">23:5</ref>. </char></note> omu maisho ge mutemu abashaija babiri abataine ku bari, bamwomesereze nibagira bati: Okyeenire Ruhanga n'omugabe. Bwanyima mumushohoze aheeru, mumuteere amabaare, afe. <verse eid="1KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Abashaija b'omuri orwo rurembo, abakuru baarwo n'abakungu abaabaire barutwiremu, baakora nk'oku Yezebeeli abatumireho omu baruha ze ezi abatwekyeire. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Baarangirira abantu okwesiibyakwo, baata Nabosi omu maisho g'abantu omu mwanya ogurikureebwa. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Bwanyima abo bashaija babiri abataine ku bari baija, baashutama omu maisho ga Nabosi, baamwomeserereza omu maisho g'abantu, nibagira bati: Nabosi akyeenire Ruhanga n'omugabe. Omuri ako kaanya baamushohoza aheeru y'orurembo, baamuteera amabaare, yaafa. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Bwanyima baatuma ahari Yezebeeli bati: Nabosi baamuteera amabaare, yaafa.<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yezebeeli, ku yaahuriire ngu Nabosi baamuteera amabaare, yaafa, yaagira Ahabu ati: Imuka, otware omusiri gw'emizaabibu ogu Nabosi owa Yezereeli abaire ayangire kukuguza; ahabw'okuba Nabosi yaafa, takiriho. <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ahonaaho Ahabu ku yaahuriire ngu Nabosi yaafa, yaimuka, yaashuuma omuri ogwo musiri gw'emizaabibu ogwa Nabosi owa Yezereeli kugutwara.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliya okutumwa kukyeena Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:12">Zab 9:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Eliya owa Tishubi, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />Imuka oshuume, obugane Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, otwire Samaria; reeba, ari omu musiri gwa Nabosi gw'emizaabibu, ogu yaashuuma kutwara; <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:38">1 Bag 22:38</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:26">2 Bag 9:26</ref>. </char></note> omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Oitsire, kandi waataho n'okunyaga? Kandi omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. Omu mwanya ogu embwa zikombeiremu eshagama ya Nabosi, nimwo zirikombera eshagama yaawe wenka. <verse eid="1KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:17">1 Bag 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:17">2 Bag 17:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahabu yaagira Eliya ati: Iwe muzigu wangye 'we, wandeeba? Yaamugarukamu ati: Naakureeba, ahakuba okeehayo kukora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Bag 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:8">2 Bag 9:8</ref>. </char></note> Niinyija kukureetaho akabi, nkwihireho kimwe, nkumareho buri mwana weena ow'omwojo, yaaba muhuuku nari ow'obusingye omuri Israeli; <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:16">1 Bag 14:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:29">15:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:3">16:3</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:11">11</ref>. </char></note> ndyagira enju yaawe nk'eya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, kandi nk'eya Baasha mwene Ahiya, ahabw'okungwisa kubi, n'okucumuza Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:36">2 Bag 9:36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebya Yezebeeli nabyo, MUKAMA yaabigambaho ati: Embwa ziryariira Yezebeeli haihi n'orugo rw'amabaare orw'orurembo Yezereeli. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:11">1 Bag 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:4">16:4</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu wa Ahabu weena origwa omu rurembo aryariibwa embwa; kandi origwa omu ishwa aryashokoorwa amahungu.<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:30-33">1 Bag 16:30-33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tihariho n'omwe owaayehaireyo kukora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA nka Ahabu, ou Yezebeeli omukazi we yaayohize. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:12">2 Bag 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:11">21:11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:16">Kut 15:16</ref>. </char></note> Akakora ebihagaro bingi munonga omu kukuratira ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, nk'ebi Abaamori baakozire byona, abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="1KI 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:16">2 Sam 12:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahabu ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaajwara ebiguniya, yaayesiibyakwo abyami omu biguniya, yaagyenda ayeinamiriire. <verse eid="1KI 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Eliya owa Tishubi, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:25">2 Bag 9:25</ref>. </char></note> Oreebire Ahabu oku ayecureize omu maisho gangye? Ahabw'okwecureeza omu maisho gangye, tindireeta kabii omu busingye bwe; kureka omu busingye bw'omutabani nimwo ndireetera akabi aha nju ye.<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ahabu na Yehoshafaati okuza omu naama n'okwehanuuza ahari baanabi eby'orugamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 18:2-34">2 Bus 18:2-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abasiria n'Abaisraeli bakamara emyaka eshatu batarikurwana. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Kwonka omu mwaka gwa kashatu Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda yaashuuma ow'omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:5">2 Bus 22:5</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira abagaragwa be ati: Timurikumanya Ramosi-gileadi ku eri eyaitu? Mbwenu twetsirize titwagiiha mu mikono y'omugabe wa Siria. <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:7">2 Bag 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Yaabuuza Yehoshafaati ati: Noija kuhurura naanye, tuteere Ramosi-gileadi? Yehoshafaati yaagira omugabe wa Israeli ati: Nyowe naiwe turi bamwe, abantu bangye nibo baawe, n'embaraasi zangye nizo zaawe.<verse eid="1KI 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Yehoshafaati yaagira omugabe wa Israeli ati: Ninkweshengyereza, banza oyehanuuze ahari MUKAMA, oreebe eki arikugamba eri izooba. <verse eid="1KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">1 Bag 18:19</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaateeranira ahamwe baanabi, abashaija magana ana, yaababuuza ati: Nteere Ramosi-gileadi, nari ndereere? Baamugarukamu bati: Irooko ohurure, ahakuba MUKAMA naija kugihayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:11">2 Bag 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yehoshafaati yaagaruka yaabuuza ati: Beitu shi aha, tihariho nabi wa MUKAMA, tukamubuuza? <verse eid="1KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Hakiriho omushaija omwe ou turikubaasa kwehanuuzaho ebya MUKAMA, niwe Mikaaya mwene Imula; kwonka nimmwanga, ahabw'okuba tandagurira birungi kureka ebibi. Yehoshafaati yaagira ati: Nyakusinga, reka kugamba otyo. <verse eid="1KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaayeta omukuru w'abaserukare, yaamugira ati: Ndahukiza Mikaaya mwene Imula. <verse eid="1KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Obwo omugabe wa Israeli na Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda bakaba bashutami aha bitebe byabo eby'obugabe, bajwaire zaabushuuti zaabo, bari aha mbuga omu irembo rya Samaria, baanabi boona babari omu maisho nibaragura. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Zedekia mwene Kenaana yaayekorera amahembe g'ekyoma, yaaragura ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Aga mahembe nigo oraabingise Abasiria okuhitsya obu baraacwekyerere. <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Kandi na baanabi boona baaragura batyo, nibagira bati: Irooko oteere Ramosi-gileadi, osingure; MUKAMA naija kugihayo omu mikono y'omugabe.<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuragura kwa Mikaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Entumwa eyaaza kweta Mikaaya yaamugira eti: Reeba, ebigambo bya baanabi nibiikirizana biragura gye aha mugabe; naiwe ebigambo byawe bibe nk'ebyabo, oragure gye. <verse eid="1KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Kub 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:13">24:13</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mikaaya yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, eki MUKAMA arangambire, nikyo ndaagambe. <verse eid="1KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Ku yaahikire omugabe, omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Mikaaya, tuteere Ramosi-gileadi, nari turereere? Yaamugarukamu ati: Hurura osingure; MUKAMA naija kugihayo omu mikono y'omugabe. <verse eid="1KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Omugabe yaamugira ati: Niinyija kukurahiza kangahi otarikungambira kindi omu iziina rya MUKAMA kureka amazima? <verse eid="1KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Ndeebire Abaisraeli boona bataataaniire aha bibungo nk'entaama ezitaine muriisa; MUKAMA yaagira ati: Aba tibaine mukama waabo; boona bagarukyeyo n'obusingye, buri muntu omu ka ye. <verse eid="1KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Tinakugambira nti: Tarikwija kundagurira birungi kureka ebibi? <verse eid="1KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yob 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:21">Zab 103:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan 7:9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 7:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:2">Kush 4:2</ref>. </char></note> Mikaaya yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mbwenu hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Naareeba MUKAMA ashutami aha kitebe kye, n'eihe ryona ery'omu iguru ryemereire aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho; <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: N'oha oraabeihabeihe Ahabu, akateera Ramosi-gileadi, akagwayo. Omwe yaagamba okundi, n'ondi okundi. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Bwanyima haija omwoyo, gwayemerera omu maisho ga MUKAMA, gwagira guti: Niinye ndaamubeihabeihe. <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:23">Bar 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:9">Ezk 14:9</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:11">2 Tes 2:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagugira ati: Noomubeihabeihesa ki? Gwagira guti: Niinyija kugyenda, mpindukye omwoyo gw'ebishuba, ngambire omuri baanabi be boona. MUKAMA yaagira ati: Niiwe oraamubeihabeihe; kandi noija kukibaasa; irooko okore otyo. <verse eid="1KI 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo reeba, MUKAMA ataire omwoyo gw'ebishuba omuri baanabi baawe aba boona. Kandi MUKAMA akugambireho kubi.<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mat 5:39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:2">Byak 23:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Zedekia mwene Kenaana yairira haihi, yaateera Mikaaya oruhi rw'omushaaya, naagira ati: Omwoyo wa MUKAMA andabireho ata kugamba naiwe? <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaaya yaagira ati: Mbwenu oryakireeba ahari eryo izooba ku oriba nooza kweshereka omu kishengye ky'omunda. <verse eid="1KI 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira ati: Twara Mikaaya, omugarure ahari Amoni omukuru w'orurembo, na Yoasi mutabani w'omugabe, <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:10">2 Bus 16:10</ref>. </char></note> omugire oti: Oku nikwo omugabe arikugamba naagira ati: Mute ekishaija eki omu kihome, mukiriise eby'okurya kandi mukinywaise amaizi eby'akahenano, okuhitsya obu ndaagarukye n'obusingye. <verse eid="1KI 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:29">Kub 16:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:22">Bir 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Mikaaya yaagira ati: Ku oraagarukye n'obusingye, biri MUKAMA tagambire naaraba omuriinye. Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Naimwe bantu 'mwe mwena, mukihurire!<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Israeli na Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda bainamuka, baateera Ramosi-gileadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:22">2 Bus 35:22</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Nyowe naaza kwehindura, nze kurwana, kwonka iwe ogume ojwaire eby'okujwara byawe by'obugabe. Omugabe wa Israeli yaayehindura, yaaza aha rugamba. <verse eid="1KI 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Kandi omugabe wa Siria akaba aragiire abakuru makumi ashatu na babiri b'ebigaari bye by'okurwanisa, ati: Mutarwana n'abato n'obu baakuba abakuru, kureka omugabe wa Israeli wenka. <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Abo bakuru b'ebigaari ku baareebire Yehoshafaati, baagira bati: Buzima oriya niwe mugabe wa Israeli. Baakubuuka kurwana nawe; Yehoshafaati yaateera enduuru. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Abakuru b'ebigaari ku baareebire atari mugabe wa Israeli, baagarukayo, baareka kumubinga. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:23">2 Bus 35:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omushaija yaananuura obuta, yaafa okurasha omwambi, yaateera omugabe wa Israeli ahu ebijwaro bye by'okurwanisa n'eky'aha kifuba birikuteeranira; nawe nikwo kugambira omuvugi w'ekigaari kye ati: Hinduka, onyihe omu rugamba, ahabw'okuba naahutaara munonga. <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Eryo izooba orugamba rwayeyongyera amaani, omugabe baamuhigika omu kigaari kye naareeba Abasiria, okuhitsya obu yaafiire omu mwabazyo; n'eshagama yaaruga omu buhuta, yaahimintika yaatarama omu kigaari. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, haabaho okurangirira omu ihe ryona nibagira bati: Buri muntu agarukye omu rurembo rwabo n'omu nsi yaabo.<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Atyo omugabe yaafa, baamureeta Samaria, baamuziikayo. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">1 Bag 21:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ekigaari kye baakyogyeza aha kiyanja kya Samaria, n'embwa zaakombera eshagama ye, ahu baamaraaya baabaire boogyera, nk'ekigambo eki MUKAMA yaagambire oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="1KI 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Endiijo mirimo ya Ahabu n'ebi yaakozire byona, na nyaruju ye ei yaayombekyeise emiino, n'endembo zoona ezi yaayombekire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Atyo Ahabu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, omutabani Ahazia yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Yehoshafaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:41-43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:31-33:19">2 Bus 20:31—33:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoshafaati mwene Asa akatandika kutegyeka Yuda omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Obu yaatandika kutegyeka, akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu n'etaano; yaategyekyera emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano omuri Yerusaalemu; kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Azuuba, muhara wa Shiluhi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:14">1 Bag 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:3">2 Bag 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:3">2 Bus 17:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyendera omu mihanda yoona eya Asa ishe, tiyaateishuka kugirugamu, kureka yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA; kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu tiyaihwaho, kureka abantu baaguma nibatambirirayo ebitambo, n'okwotererayo obubaane. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:1">2 Bus 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:35">20:35</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 20:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yehoshafaati yaaragaana endagaano y'obusingye n'omugabe wa Israeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:34">2 Bus 20:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Endiijo mirimo ya Yehoshafaati n'amaani agu yaayorekire n'oku yaarwaine engamba, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:24">1 Bag 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:12">15:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebitingwa ebyatsigaireho omu busingye bwa Asa ishe, yaabimara omu nsi.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:14">2 Sam 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:9">2 Bag 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">8:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Edomu hakaba hatarimu mugabe, kureka omutsigire. <verse eid="1KI 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:26">1 Bag 9:26</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 9:28">28</ref>. </char></note> Yehoshafaati akakora emeeri za Tarushiishi ez'okuza Ofiri kwihayo ezaabu; kwonka tizaahikayo, ahakuba zikafeera Ezioni-geberi. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Bwanyima Ahazia mwene Ahabu yaagira Yehoshafaati ati: Reka abashaija bangye bagyende n'abaawe omu meeri; kwonka Yehoshafaati tiyaakisiima. <verse eid="1KI 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:1">2 Bus 21:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoshafaati yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi ishenkuru; Yehoraamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Ahazia omugabe wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Ahazia mwene Ahabu akatandika kutegyeka Israeli omuri Samaria omu mwaka gwa ikumi na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda; yaamara emyaka ebiri naategyeka Israeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">1 Bag 15:26</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, naagyendera omu mihanda ya ishe na nyina, n'omu muhanda gwa Yeroboamu mwene Nebati owaasiisiise Abaisraeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:30-32">1 Bag 16:30-32</ref>. </char></note> Yaaguma naaheereza Baali, naamuramya, yaitsa MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli ekiniga omu muringo gwona ogu ishe yaatwarizemu.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>